works","reference_year":2016,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.06993"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_learned_planning","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Planning with a learned model","label":"Planning with a learned model","summary":"학습된 dynamics 예측을 탐색과 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_normalization","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"S4 residual normalization","label":"S4 residual normalization","summary":"상태공간 출력과 residual 경로를 결합해 정규화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f27ded9a6ce85428d7cf3a88","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"Transformer 인코더·디코더를 영상 집합 예측에 맞게 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2, Fig.2; official models/transformer.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/detr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fb3eaa2aa245c39aa57b2c37","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"정의와 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"Paper §2–3; official implementation modules","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_processor"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cc17b2efe7f97f90e8e12713","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"RoFormer: Self-Attention 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/14331a9ee40d3ea115a31c7b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"explanation":"PlaNet 계열의 잠재 세계 모델에서 행동을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/planet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3235a09d911904f9ec6ebe05","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"다음 토큰 예측 언어 모델 목적을 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/retnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ccaaf6410702c43e87c95687","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"그래프 분류 선형 head입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"§4.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_classifier"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet","@type":"Paper","author":["Kaiming He","Xiangyu Zhang","Shaoqing Ren","Jian Sun"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition","label":"Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition","reference_year":2015,"summary":"모델과 개념을 설명하는 대표 문헌입니다. 원문에서 해당 구조와 주장 범위를 확인할 수 있습니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03385"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/37e1872161cc7fcd747712ae","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: Self-Attention 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/dino_self_distillation","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DINO self-distillation loss","label":"DINO self-distillation loss","summary":"temperature가 다른 학생·중심화 교사 분포 사이의 교차 엔트로피를 최소화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/understanding"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"BERT","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"BERT","label":"BERT","reference_year":2018,"runtime_id":"bert","runtime_note":"작은 실제 Hugging Face BERT 구성. 임의 초기화이며 사전학습은 수행하지 않습니다.","summary":"마스킹된 토큰 예측 등으로 양방향 Transformer 인코더를 사전 학습합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/masked_lm"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/bidirectional_context"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/74079a622f8ed14f7029a22a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 그래프 어텐션.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/graph_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/983bc8f99fa11b96934c8744","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"후속 비전 과제를 위한 표현을 자기지도 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"Abstract; §4–5","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/byol"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f3e049208f09c102e484ee87","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"Long Range Arena와 순차 이미지 분류 목적을 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/s4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_advantage_stream","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Advantage stream","label":"Advantage stream","summary":"공유 특징에서 행동별 상대적 이점을 추정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/068157982255232bd6f7c647","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"원소 인코더의 파라미터를 모든 원소에 공유합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"§2–3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/element_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shared_element_encoding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/semiseparable_matrix","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Semiseparable sequence matrix","label":"Semiseparable sequence matrix","summary":"낮은 반분리 rank를 가져 recurrent와 parallel 형태 모두로 계산 가능한 인과 행렬입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/retention","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Retention mechanism","label":"Retention mechanism","summary":"내용 기반 상호작용과 시간 감쇠를 결합해 과거 정보를 병렬 또는 순환 형태로 유지합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weighted_key_value","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Weighted key-value recurrence","label":"Weighted key-value recurrence","summary":"시간 감쇠가 적용된 key-weighted value 통계를 순환 상태로 누적합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e2e48e6883ec0e32e4aaa1cc","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/object_queries"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backcast_forecast_decomposition","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Backcast–forecast decomposition","label":"Backcast–forecast decomposition","summary":"관측 history의 설명 성분과 미래 예측 성분을 한 block에서 함께 산출합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e03837dd3c33582beadcf528","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/clip"},"explanation":"CLIP: 텍스트 인코더.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/clip"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/clip"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/text_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/deepsets","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/set_learning"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"family":"set","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/element_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/set_sum_pool"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/set_readout"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Deep Sets","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"DeepSets","label":"Deep Sets","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"deepsets","runtime_note":"7개 원소에 공유 MLP를 적용하고 합 풀링과 집합 readout을 거치는 작은 rho(sum(phi(x))) 예제입니다. 무작위 초기화이며 논문 실험을 재현하지 않습니다.","summary":"공유 원소 인코더의 출력을 합산한 뒤 집합 수준 함수를 학습해 입력 순서에 불변인 예측을 만듭니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/permutation_invariance"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shared_element_encoding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sum_decomposition"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b851e0782d5fe023f2dde821","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dueling_dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8b8b7f9a1778c46e8d8f8098","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"explanation":"직접 최적화되는 학생 backbone입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"locator":"Fig.2; official MultiCropWrapper","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/student_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c261d0b49fbd9023e04eb28c","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"explanation":"직접 학습되는 query 경로입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"locator":"Fig.2; Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/moco"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/query_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4b0fe379c4e4647e291f27b8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"S4 block은 residual 연결과 normalization을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"§4; Appendix D","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/s4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_normalization"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/clip","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/image_text"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/clip"},"family":"multimodal","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/image_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/text_encoder"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"CLIP","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"CLIP","label":"CLIP","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"clip","runtime_note":"Transformers CLIP의 작은 영상·텍스트 encoder와 8차원 투영. 정규화된 표현의 유사도 logits를 출력합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"영상과 텍스트 인코더를 대조 목적을 이용해 공동 표현 공간으로 연결합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/contrastive"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/lstm","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"family":"sequence","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/recurrent"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"LSTM","label":"LSTM","reference_year":1997,"runtime_id":"lstm","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"게이트와 셀 상태를 추가해 긴 시점 간 정보와 기울기의 전달을 다룹니다. PyTorch 구현의 현대적 게이트 구성과 원 논문의 구체적 구성은 구별합니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/gating"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/memory_cell"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3f648bdb4f2142488e32f96f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"PointNet Fig. 2; §3–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/point_segmentation"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0f10b56c617788ddf3464da7","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"explanation":"dynamics 함수가 상태 미분을 매개변수화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"locator":"§2, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/neuralode"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neural_vector_field"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/eabf372c9469142580368aa8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: 위치별 FFN.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Encoder–Decoder","label":"Encoder–Decoder","summary":"입력을 표현하는 인코더와 조건부 출력을 생성하는 디코더의 구성."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9d4b0488ca2e126d4b922ec7","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/a3c"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d0e85280e693de970621aa79","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"explanation":"명시된 기반 기법의 구조 또는 학습법을 확장합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/double_dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dqn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8de9b60a800a9b87591971d3","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"대표 SE-ResNet 구성은 residual branch를 재보정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"§3.3; Fig.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/senet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/88b5a6caf6e1991456761062","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"explanation":"이산 및 연속 제어에 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/option_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/graph_classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn"},"family":"graph","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/gin_layer"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_sum_pool"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_classifier"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"GIN","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Graph Isomorphism Network","label":"GIN","reference_year":2019,"runtime_id":"gin","runtime_note":"5개 노드 그래프 두 개에 한 층의 learnable-epsilon GIN, 그래프 합 readout과 분류기를 실행합니다. 다층 jumping knowledge, 배치 정규화, 데이터셋 학습과 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"이웃 합과 MLP의 injective 갱신으로 WL 검정 수준의 그래프 구별력을 목표로 하는 Graph Isomorphism Network입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/injective_aggregation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/wl_expressivity"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9cd66597db383313a5d7b1c6","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dense_connections"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/skip_connections"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/979ba5a954f0025259d12b03","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"explanation":"스킬 조건부 동역학을 추정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dads"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_dynamics"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/721cee5fa75ba5d37d75e608","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"정의와 구조적 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"SimCLR §2–3; official implementation","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/contrastive_projector"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8121c31269a7148935274316","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Fig.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/view_color_head"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_encoder","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"잠재 분포 인코더","label":"잠재 분포 인코더","summary":"자료를 조건부 잠재 분포로 변환.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/20d58c97b7e31a12018cee5e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/reinforce"},"explanation":"순차 제어 또는 게임 의사결정에 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/reinforce"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/reinforce"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e6cbea15bf6864eb95fc756b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"explanation":"Fourier 공간에서 kernel integral operator를 매개변수화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"locator":"§3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/fno"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/fourier_operator"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/decision_step_aggregation","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Decision-step aggregation","label":"Decision-step aggregation","summary":"각 step의 decision representation을 합쳐 최종 예측을 만듭니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet","@type":"Paper","author":["Yann LeCun","Léon Bottou","Yoshua Bengio","Patrick Haffner"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Gradient-Based Learning Applied to Document Recognition","label":"Gradient-Based Learning Applied to Document Recognition","reference_year":1998,"summary":"모델과 개념을 설명하는 대표 문헌입니다. 원문에서 해당 구조와 주장 범위를 확인할 수 있습니다.","url":{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1109/5.726791"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c7b7a545aa89af23a53c33de","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"explanation":"DINO의 원논문과 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"locator":"§3; official facebookresearch/dino main_dino.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Cross-Attention","label":"Cross-Attention","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"},"summary":"질의와 key/value가 서로 다른 시퀀스에서 주어지는 어텐션."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7661409f0ffc28b5ae083156","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"explanation":"여러 step의 decision output을 합쳐 prediction을 만듭니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"locator":"§3.1, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tabnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/decision_step_aggregation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8a312fdfb7b00e6e46cc98c1","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/squeeze_excitation","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Squeeze-and-excitation","label":"Squeeze-and-excitation","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_recalibration"},"summary":"공간 정보를 squeeze한 뒤 작은 gating network로 채널 간 의존성을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e4107e9a907f4c0edd8f2d57","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: Self-Attention.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/translation","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"기계 번역","label":"기계 번역","summary":"입력 언어 시퀀스를 다른 언어 시퀀스로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_sum_pool","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Graph sum readout","label":"Graph sum readout","summary":"노드 표현을 합해 그래프 수준 표현을 만듭니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/text_encoder","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"텍스트 인코더","label":"텍스트 인코더","summary":"텍스트를 비교 가능한 표현 공간으로 변환.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/100f9ef7263eccf0092ba038","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"explanation":"비지도 스킬을 발견합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dads"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_skill_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f0c5b4ae40e4158d0f3f6745","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"블록별 정규화와 잔차 경로를 조건에 따라 변조합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3, Fig.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/adaln_block"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adaptive_layer_norm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow","@type":"Paper","author":["Matteo Hessel","Joseph Modayil","Hado van Hasselt","Tom Schaul","Georg Ostrovski","Will Dabney","Dan Horgan","Bilal Piot","Mohammad Azar","David Silver"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Rainbow: Combining Improvements in Deep Reinforcement Learning","label":"Rainbow: Combining Improvements in Deep Reinforcement Learning","reference_year":2017,"summary":"Rainbow의 대표 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.02298"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8c92690f7b68c874ce022b94","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"학습된 객체 질의를 디코더 입력 슬롯으로 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2, Fig.2; official models/detr.py (query_embed); models/transformer.py (Transformer.forward)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/detr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/object_queries"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/57226f8442ef092c9d17925a","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/reparameterization","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"재매개화","label":"재매개화","summary":"확률 표본을 매개변수와 외부 잡음의 미분 가능한 함수로 표현합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/unseen_node_representation","@type":"Task","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Unseen-node representation","label":"Unseen-node representation","summary":"훈련 중 보지 못한 노드나 새 그래프의 특징에서 표현을 생성합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/28888eb3a77d1b5b80b030b8","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"explanation":"실행 예제의 공유 특징 추출기입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/option_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8d87541774f377d2cb09a692","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"원 아키텍처는 계층별 고정 크기 이웃 표본을 집계합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§2, Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neighbor_aggregator"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neighborhood_sampling"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nbeats","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/time_series_forecasting"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"family":"time-series-forecasting","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/nbeats_block_stack"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/nbeats_block_mlp"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/backcast_head"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/forecast_head"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"N-BEATS","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Neural Basis Expansion Analysis","label":"N-BEATS","reference_year":2020,"runtime_id":"nbeats","runtime_note":"길이 12 history를 두 개의 generic fully connected block으로 처리해 길이 4 forecast를 생성합니다. block별 backcast subtraction과 forecast addition은 실행하지만, 원논문의 깊은 stack·trend/seasonality 해석 basis·ensemble과 대규모 M4 학습은 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"fully connected block이 backcast와 forecast를 동시에 출력하고 residual history와 forecast를 서로 다른 방향으로 누적하는 시계열 예측 구조입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/point_forecasting"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/doubly_residual_stacking"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/basis_expansion"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backcast_forecast_decomposition"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c94e74a4de3ff4d62ef1a568","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e152a120c2794b8b7b9f9340","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"explanation":"RNN · Elman 계열의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/generator","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Generator","label":"Generator","summary":"잠재 입력을 자료 공간으로 변환.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/58cb96e517a117980309f503","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"정의와 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"Paper §2–3; official implementation modules","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_classifier"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/backcast_head","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Backcast head","label":"Backcast head","summary":"현재 block이 설명할 관측 history 성분을 출력합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cf473b7dd0405d1ceca4eff5","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/visual_representation"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ef8852710111d7ac201622f6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"locator":"Ti