","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Fig.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/radiance_mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol","@type":"Paper","author":["Jean-Bastien Grill","Florian Strub","Florent Altché","Corentin Tallec","Pierre H. Richemond","Elena Buchatskaya","Carl Doersch","Bernardo Avila Pires","Zhaohan Daniel Guo","Mohammad Gheshlaghi Azar","Bilal Piot","Koray Kavukcuoglu","Rémi Munos","Michal Valko"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Bootstrap Your Own Latent: A New Approach to Self-Supervised Learning","label":"Bootstrap Your Own Latent: A New Approach to Self-Supervised Learning","reference_year":2020,"summary":"온라인 네트워크가 EMA 표적 네트워크의 다른 시점 표현을 예측하는 BYOL 원논문.","url":{"@id":"https://papers.nips.cc/paper/2020/hash/f3ada80d5c4ee70142b17b8192b2958e-Abstract.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rwkv_channel_mix","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RWKV channel-mix","label":"RWKV channel-mix","summary":"gated squared-ReLU projection으로 채널을 혼합합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_mixing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/understanding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/translation"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/expert"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/router"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Switch Transformer","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"SWITCH","label":"Switch Transformer","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"switch","runtime_note":"Transformers Switch 2-expert top-1 routing. encoder와 decoder에 실제 sparse FFN을 포함하며 capacity는 16입니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"T5의 FFN 일부를 희소 전문가와 토큰별 라우팅으로 확장합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/span_corruption"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sparse_experts"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/da987bcb63b39b186f1e3bc1","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"explanation":"보상을 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_reward"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bfb3def1c2144cf697b8038b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/84d07a23908b43604a1c9fbd","@type":"Claim","basis":"docume