p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/deepsets"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/element_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/inductive_graph_learning","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Inductive graph learning","label":"Inductive graph learning","summary":"훈련에 없던 노드나 그래프에도 공유 집계 함수를 적용해 표현을 생성합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e0e7420a527ea5d4ffaf2402","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"점구름 분류를 포함한 집합 분류 실험을 보고합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"§4.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/deepsets"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads","@type":"Paper","author":["Archit Sharma","Shixiang Gu","Sergey Levine","Vikash Kumar","Karol Hausman"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Dynamics-Aware Unsupervised Discovery of Skills","label":"Dynamics-Aware Unsupervised Discovery of Skills","reference_year":2019,"summary":"예측 가능한 스킬의 조건부 동역학과 정책을 학습합니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1907.01657"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"family":"self-supervised","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/student_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/teacher_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/student_head"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/teacher_head"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DINO","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Self-Distillation with No Labels","label":"DINO","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"dino","runtime_note":"16×16 전역·국소 시점을 작은 student/teacher CNN과 2층 head로 처리하고 centered teacher 분포의 자기증류 손실을 제공합니다. multi-crop 생성, EMA·center 갱신 반복, ViT 대규모 학습과 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"학생과 모멘텀 교사의 확률 분포를 centering·sharpening과 함께 맞추는 레이블 없는 자기증류 구조입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/dino_self_distillation"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_distillation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multi_crop"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/teacher_centering"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_action_embedding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_causal_transformer"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Dreamer 4","label":"Dreamer 4","reference_year":2025,"runtime_id":"dreamer4_rl","runtime_note":"행동과 관측을 더해 작은 causal Transformer에 전달하고 복원·정책·가치 head를 실행합니다. 실제 diffusion 세계 모델, shortcut forcing, 영상 학습과 imagined RL은 포함하지 않는 구조적 설명 예제입니다.","summary":"확장 가능한 행동 조건부 세계 모델에서 강화학습 행동을 학습합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_video_world_model"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_latent_imagination"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/323e90a0452e726df76a25af","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"세계 모델의 시각 예측 경로를 표현합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2a5c7d996e076280eeebbad3","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"ViT 기반 인코더를 가시 패치에 적용하고 별도 디코더로 가려진 픽셀을 복원합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr","@type":"Paper","author":["Nicolas Carion","Francisco Massa","Gabriel Synnaeve","Nicolas Usunier","Alexander Kirillov","Sergey Zagoruyko"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"End-to-End Object Detection with Transformers","label":"End-to-End Object Detection with Transformers","reference_year":2020,"summary":"집합 예측과 Transformer 인코더·디코더로 종단간 객체 탐지를 구성한 원논문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.12872"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/dc4ce7cd01c5183db8ee0caa","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"adaLN-Zero 조건부 Transformer 블록을 반복합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3, Fig.3; official DiTBlock","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/adaln_block"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neighborhood_sampling","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Neighborhood sampling","label":"Neighborhood sampling","summary":"각 계층에서 고정 수의 이웃을 표본화해 계산 범위를 제한합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino","@type":"Paper","author":["Mathilde Caron","Hugo Touvron","Ishan Misra","Hervé Jégou","Julien Mairal","Piotr Bojanowski","Armand Joulin"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Emerging Properties in Self-Supervised Vision Transformers","label":"Emerging Properties in Self-Supervised Vision Transformers","reference_year":2021,"summary":"레이블 없는 자기증류, 모멘텀 교사, centering과 multi-crop을 결합한 DINO 원논문이며 facebookresearch/dino가 공식 구현입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Caron_Emerging_Properties_in_Self-Supervised_Vision_Transformers_ICCV_2021_paper.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c372901deeaa3979c9bcf97c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"토큰별 예측을 잠재 패치로 되돌립니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3; official FinalLayer and unpatchify","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/diffusion_output_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/online_encoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"BYOL online encoder","label":"BYOL online encoder","summary":"역전파로 직접 갱신되는 온라인 시각 인코더입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_value_learning","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Action-value learning","label":"Action-value learning","summary":"상태와 행동의 예상 누적 보상을 추정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/016d55e9773aa109dfcb25c6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: 윈도 어텐션.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/window_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d40c7dbb71a0ba2292280b3f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"잠재 공간 상상으로 actor–critic을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_latent_imagination"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f1beba4c9ad2ed726e709067","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"Transformer가 조건부 세계 모델을 구성합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_causal_transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0b99e5557ecf9f675a4b6bfb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"explanation":"옵션 정책과 종료를 환경 보상으로 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/option_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/230d3139195dc5bd6cec510c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f180a9d1e2f46790252584df","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: 희소 전문가.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sparse_experts"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/421631c74f4ed581c1cf1623","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"explanation":"구조를 이루는 주요 구성 요소.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.