 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§2–3; official graphsage/aggregators.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neighbor_aggregator"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"비선형 활성화","label":"비선형 활성화","summary":"가중합 뒤에 비선형 변환을 적용해 표현력을 높입니다. 임계 함수와 미분 가능한 활성화는 구분합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae","@type":"Paper","author":["Diederik P. Kingma","Max Welling"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Auto-Encoding Variational Bayes","label":"Auto-Encoding Variational Bayes","reference_year":2013,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/408a6289dc67e19d73d4d6f2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"explanation":"SAC를 소개한 논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/sac"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/15b5e1f11a974875d028f8a0","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"explanation":"엔트로피를 포함한 장기 보상을 추구합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/sac"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco","@type":"Paper","author":["Kaiming He","Haoqi Fan","Yuxin Wu","Saining Xie","Ross Girshick"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Momentum Contrast for Unsupervised Visual Representation Learning","label":"Momentum Contrast for Unsupervised Visual Representation Learning","reference_year":2020,"summary":"동적 사전, 모멘텀 키 인코더와 큐를 결합한 MoCo 원논문이며 facebookresearch/moco가 공식 PyTorch 구현입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2020/html/He_Momentum_Contrast_for_Unsupervised_Visual_Representation_Learning_CVPR_2020_paper.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f6146e9aa89118d144658175","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"explanation":"PPO의 actor–critic 구현은 정책 업데이트에 clipped objective를 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ppo"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9edb6f77d5afb58a0cf055d5","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/recurrent"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9de1a00da0c54122d6805c96","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"잠재 질의와 입력 key/value 사이의 교차 어텐션입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"§2.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/asymmetric_attention"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bb2781413b4fe081f46539bf","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"explanation":"CNN · LeNet 계열의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f48e393aef56634ad528e4ec","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"explanation":"Mamba: 선택적 SSM 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/state_space"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/separable_convolution","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Depthwise-Separable 합성곱","label":"Depthwise-Separable 합성곱","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},"summary":"채널별 공간 합성곱과 pointwise 채널 결합을 분리합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/inception","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Inception · GoogLeNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"INCEPTION","label":"Inception · GoogLeNet","reference_year":2014,"runtime_id":"inception","runtime_note":"torchvision GoogLeNet의 병렬 Inception 분기. 보조 분류기를 끈 64×64 입력 예제입니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"서로 다른 크기의 특징 경로를 결합하는 다중 스케일 합성곱 구조.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multiscale"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/retnet","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"family":"sequence","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_qkv"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_core"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_gate"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_output_projection"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RetNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Retentive Network","label":"RetNet","reference_year":2023,"runtime_id":"retnet","runtime_note":"길이 12·폭 8 입력을 폭 16의 두 retention head로 투영해 서로 다른 고정 감쇠율의 병렬 causal retention, SiLU gate와 출력 투영을 실행합니다. recurrent/chunkwise cache, 토큰 임베딩·LM head, 전체 RetNet block stack과 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"감쇠 retention을 병렬 학습과 고정 상태 순환 추론의 동등한 형태로 계산하는 언어 모델 기반 구조입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/retention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multi_scale_retention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/parallel_recurrent_equivalence"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_state_embedding","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"State embedding","label":"State embedding","summary":"상태를 토큰으로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9baccc958e0ac22860a35607","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"잠재 상태를 추정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_posterior"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/32006b6e16dcde9c1787689a","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"합성곱 네트워크에 잔차 학습 구조를 연결하는 구조적 비교입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6080aacb219cd838ef04f63c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"학습 가능한 임베딩이 고정 개수 객체 슬롯을 구성합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2; official models/detr.py (query_embed)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/object_queries"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/object_queries"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/08ab4d5bf6e70c022ac2520c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"explanation":"DreamerV2 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/masked_pixel_reconstruction","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Masked-pixel reconstruction","label":"Masked-pixel reconstruction","summary":"가려진 패치의 픽셀만 복원 손실에 포함합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0341b7f921b9b4a48b3e3b9e","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"다양한 제어 환경에서 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0488a97b28358be04eac0ab6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_embedding","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Skill representation","label":"Skill representation","summary":"스킬 ID를 조건 표현으로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8fce96c30ef37b6942c1e01d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"explanation":"잠재 상태를 사용해 행동을 선택합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f9b255fe2df97baef2c7160a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"조건 벡터에서 shift, scale, gate를 만듭니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3; official DiTBlock","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/adaln_modulation"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adaptive_layer_norm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7d2492b83a9752203bcd3595","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"평균은 sample-and-aggregate의 구체적 집계 함수입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/mean_aggregation"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sample_and_aggregate"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a30e966e8998f13d0ee4817c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"explanation":"TabNet과 Google Research 공식 구현의 원문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"locator":"§3; google-research/tabnet","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tabnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"전문가 라우팅","label":"전문가 라우팅","summary":"토큰을 처리할 전문가를 선택합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/99a3024a2b068d18e8df8498","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"분류와 분할 네트워크를 지도 목적함수로 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_skill_learning"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_embedding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_discriminator"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DIAYN","label":"DIAYN","reference_year":2018,"runtime_id":"diayn_rl","runtime_note":"4개 스킬 임베딩을 이용하는 작은 조건부 정책과 상태–스킬 분류기를 실행합니다. 최대 엔트로피 RL, 상호정보량 보상, 환경과 학습 루프는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"스킬 조건부 정책과 상태로부터 스킬을 예측하는 판별기를 활용해 다양한 스킬을 발견합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_skill_diversity"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_skill_discovery"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ode_input_projection","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"ODE input projection","label":"ODE input projection","summary":"입력을 연속 dynamics의 상태 폭으로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_discriminator","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Skill discriminator","label":"Skill discriminator","summary":"상태로부터 스킬을 판별합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"순환 상태","label":"순환 상태","summary":"이전 시점의 상태를 다음 시점의 계산에 전달합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Sequential control","label":"Sequential control","summary":"환경과 상호작용하며 행동을 선택합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/912eecb92ce5c74c51a1a449","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"표적 투영기도 온라인 투영기의 EMA로 갱신됩니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"§2, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/target_projector"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/momentum_target"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/51d807f2e61b9e3d0afdb2a2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"explanation":"U-Net: 영상 분할.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn","@type":"Paper","author":["Ziyu Wang","Tom Schaul","Matteo Hessel","Hado van Hasselt","Marc Lanctot","Nando de Freitas"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Dueling Network Architectures for Deep Reinforcement Learning","l