p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/student_encoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DINO student encoder","label":"DINO student encoder","summary":"다양한 crop을 받아 직접 최적화되는 학생 시각 인코더입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Observation decoder","label":"Observation decoder","summary":"잠재 상태에서 관측을 복원합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3e6ce464771c654f4d4f60fb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"explanation":"표 분류와 회귀 task loss로 end-to-end 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tabnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9df096dbaec77e17d8bb60c9","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"explanation":"dilation이 증가하는 temporal block을 쌓습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tcn_temporal_blocks"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d8cc0488cf1754a0db013a51","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: 위치 정보.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFr