com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_value_stream"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn","@type":"Paper","author":["Shaojie Bai","J. Zico Kolter","Vladlen Koltun"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"An Empirical Evaluation of Generic Convolutional and Recurrent Networks for Sequence Modeling","label":"An Empirical Evaluation of Generic Convolutional and Recurrent Networks for Sequence Modeling","reference_year":2018,"summary":"팽창 인과 합성곱과 residual block으로 구성한 generic TCN을 순환 모델과 비교한 원논문이며 locuslab/TCN이 저자 공식 구현입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.01271"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_self_play","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Self-play and search","label":"Self-play and search","summary":"자기 대국과 탐색으로 정책·가치 학습 데이터를 만듭니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/student_head","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DINO student head","label":"DINO student head","summary":"학생 표현을 자기증류 분포 logits로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e93343275fa6aef574e869e0","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"오토인코더의 잠재 표현 위에 확산 생성 과정을 결합합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3, Fig.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ldm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_decoder","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"잠재 디코더","label":"잠재 디코더","summary":"잠재 변수로부터 자료를 복원.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/726fe0c86b5be8be93b52465","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"max pooling의 채널 최댓값을 제공하는 critical points가 표현을 결정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"§3.2; §3.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/critical_point_selection"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/50b6a882729780d671fea460","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"PointNet Fig. 2; §3–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/shape_classifier"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b4d50ff5b78719e38448ec72","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"explanation":"DenseNet: Dense 연결.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/densenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dense_connections"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/senet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"family":"convolutional","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/se_residual_block"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/squeeze_pool"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/excitation_mlp"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/channel_scale"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"SENet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Squeeze-and-Excitation Network","label":"SENet","reference_year":2018,"runtime_id":"senet","runtime_note":"16×16 영상을 폭 8의 작은 SE residual block으로 처리합니다. 전역 평균 squeeze, 2층 excitation gate, 채널 scale과 분류 head가 실제 모듈입니다. SENet-154의 전체 stage 구성, 대규모 ImageNet 학습과 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"전역 squeeze와 학습된 excitation으로 합성곱 특징 채널을 입력별로 재보정하는 시각 인식 구조입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_recalibration"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/squeeze_excitation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_backbone","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DETR image backbone","label":"DETR image backbone","summary":"입력을 Transformer 토큰용 공간 특징 지도로 변환합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/85bb08358d295927b663d3fb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"explanation":"EfficientNet: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"EfficientNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"EFFICIENTNET","label":"EfficientNet","reference_year":2019,"runtime_id":"efficientnet","runtime_note":"torchvision EfficientNet-B0의 MBConv와 squeeze-excitation. 32×32 입력·4종 분류 예제입니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"깊이·너비·해상도의 균형을 맞춰 합성곱 모델을 확장합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/compound_scaling"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/depthwise"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e5b0dfc052adc8c50064c430","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mobilenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e75b17494ba2def641af8215","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"원논문과 공식 구현에 대응하는 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"§2.1, Fig.2; official perceiver.py CrossAttention","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceiver"},