mponent","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Feed-forward 전문가","label":"Feed-forward 전문가","summary":"일부 입력에 선택되어 활성화되는 FFN.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/499f85991dfbe8842bb57608","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"관측을 특징으로 변환합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/437144d8f4ec6972ee7744dc","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"합과 MLP가 multiset에 대한 injective 함수를 근사합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"Theorem 3; Eq.4.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/injective_aggregation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2b98186bfb2e8afd39898f8f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"explanation":"Burgers, Darcy, Navier–Stokes solution operator를 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/fno"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/pde_operator_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/64ed20f211cd165d3aa73c05","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"