kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multi_crop"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f397652ceb5fd214d6efb3a9","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"표본 이웃의 정보를 반복 전달해 노드 표현을 갱신합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§2, Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sample_and_aggregate"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2ae586c04b15a16a60649c79","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"SE 모듈을 residual 변환에 결합합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"Fig.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/senet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/se_residual_block"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8c1ca905344154ed2caa0354","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"공유 함수로 이웃을 표본화·집계하는 귀납 구조입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§2, Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neighborhood_sampling"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6fbceeee3078730d10a22255","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"전역 표현 이후의 분류 MLP입니다.","http://www.w3.org/