2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_sum_pool"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/21b47381f0ba7602846df8bc","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"explanation":"공식 MixerBlock에서 해당 축의 MLP를 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"locator":"Paper §2, Fig.1; https://github.com/google-research/vision_transformer/blob/main/vit_jax/models_mixer.py (MixerBlock, MlpMixer)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/token_mixer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/token_mixing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/20a555b4391138b91e7d7980","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/radiance_field","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Neural radiance field","label":"Neural radiance field","summary":"연속 공간 위치와 시선 방향을 밀도와 방출 색으로 매핑합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/27a4107fb84d28bb939ca79d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"explanation":"상상된 잠재 경로에서 행동을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg