www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/muzero"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_dynamics"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/93e79a2f57d81015af5c6b47","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"채널 최댓값을 제공하는 점이 전역 표현에 남습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"§3.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/symmetric_max_pool"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/critical_point_selection"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ce1e5328c76ab213b0f34b11","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/planet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/shape_classifier","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Shape classifier","label":"Shape classifier","summary":"전역 점구름 표현을 물체 범주 로짓으로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv2","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_componen