ype":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"HiPPO memory initialization","label":"HiPPO memory initialization","summary":"과거 신호를 직교 다항식 계수로 압축하도록 상태공간을 초기화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/adaln_block","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"adaLN Transformer block","label":"adaLN Transformer block","summary":"조건별 정규화·잔차 게이트를 갖는 self-attention과 MLP 블록입니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adaptive_layer_norm"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3bea88fc19431fa771219d53","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/discriminator"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adversarial"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ccc24570e9dee17abc1abc68","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"그래프 분류 벤치마크에서 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"§6.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/graph_classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/shared_point_mlp","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Shared point MLP","label":"Shared point MLP","summary":"모든 점에 같은 다층 퍼셉트론을 적용해 점별 특징을 만듭니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/Ptw