-kg#component/state_space"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mamba","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"MAMBA","label":"Mamba","reference_year":2023,"runtime_id":"mamba","runtime_note":"Transformers Mamba 1층·폭 16·state 4. 입력 의존적 selective SSM과 causal convolution을 CPU 경로로 실행합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"입력에 의존하는 상태 공간 갱신으로 긴 시퀀스를 처리합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/selective_state_space"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/43da55fbfc0edfdd3dd27ff9","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"지각 압축 단계의 원문과 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3; official autoencoder.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/perceptual_compression"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet","@type":"Paper","author":["Olaf Ronneberger","Philipp Fischer","Thomas Brox"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"U-Net: Convolutional Networks for Biomedical Image Segmentation","label":"U-Net: Convolutional Networks for Biomedical Image Segmentation","reference_year":2015,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.04597"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_denoiser","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Latent U-Net denoiser","label":"Latent U-Net denoiser","summary":"시간과 문맥에 조건부인 잠재공간 노이즈 예측 U-Net입니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/Ptw