39/jaegle21a.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b1fd761841a7c6ccd81bffa1","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: Transformer 인코더 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn","@type":"Paper","author":["Benjamin Eysenbach","Abhishek Gupta","Julian Ibarz","Sergey Levine"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Diversity is All You Need: Learning Skills without a Reward Function","label":"Diversity is All You Need: Learning Skills without a Reward Function","reference_year":2018,"summary":"스킬 판별과 최대 엔트로피 정책으로 다양한 스킬을 비지도 학습합니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.06070"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2f51ab6276fe73481fa7158f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"잠재 패치화의 원문과 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3; PatchEmbed","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_patch_embed"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/causal_mask","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"인과적 마스킹","label":"인과적 마스킹","summary":"현재 위치에서 미래 위치의 토큰 정보를 가리는 제약."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/84bc03c0e0eee52c6224c3e6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/alphazero"},"explanat