-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rwkv_time_mix"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f1d3552c872af3416fcd7366","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"방사장의 색 출력을 시선 방향에 조건화한 형태입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Fig.3; official run_nerf_helpers.py (use_viewdirs)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/view_dependent_radiance"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/radiance_field"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/216418d329b8cd006131a26e","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_aggregation","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"이웃 집계","label":"이웃 집계","summary":"그래프 이웃의 표현을 결합.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4ba48eda9d91ed986e27f668","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"논문은 집합 입력의 지도 학습 과제를 포함합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/deepsets"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f739d5b790ebdf0ae50c7f14","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"explanation":"U-Net: Encoder–Decoder.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/symmetric_max_pool","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Symmetric max pooling","label":"Symmetric max pooling","summary":"각 특징 채널의 점별 최댓값을 취해 순서 불변 전역 벡터를 만듭니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/symmetric_reduction"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/critical_point_selection"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/resolution_invariance","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Resolution invariance","label":"Resolution invariance","summary":"같은 연산자 매개변수를 서로 다른 공간 이산화 해상도에 적용합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/eee00a8597b97afc1b48c6b7","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"explanation":"각 temporal block에 residual connection을 둡니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"locator":"§3.2, Fig.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual_sequence_modeling"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7f343fe2d61450aeadac8729","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"explanation":"공간적으로 local한 convolution을 Fourier 전역 operator로 일반화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/fno"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2ff64e376217d62ff04d2385","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"온라인/표적 실행 경로의 실제 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"§2, Fig.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/byol"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/online_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/visual_representation","@type":"Task","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Visual representation learning","label":"Visual representation learning","summary":"후속 비전 과제를 위한 이미지 표현 사전학습."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ldm","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/conditional_image_generation"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"extends":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpm"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae"}],"family":"generative","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/first_stage_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/first_stage_decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/conditioning_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_denoiser"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/diffusion_time_embedding"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Latent Diffusion Model","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":["LDM","Latent Diffusion"],"label":"Latent Diffusion Model","reference_year":2022,"runtime_id":"ldm","runtime_note":"16×16 이미지를 8채널 8×8 잠재로 압축하고, 작은 조건 인코더·시간 임베딩·U-Net으로 한 번의 잠재 노이즈 예측과 디코딩을 실행합니다. 다단계 샘플링, 학습된 지각 오토인코더, 대규모 텍스트 인코더와 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"사전학습한 오토인코더의 압축 잠재공간에서 조건부 U-Net으로 확산 노이즈를 예측합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/latent_denoising"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/diffusion"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_diffusion"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/perceptual_compression"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention_conditioning"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/double_dqn","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dqn"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_q_head"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Double DQN","label":"Double DQN","reference_year":2015,"runtime_id":"double_dqn_rl","runtime_note":"동일한 Q-network 추론 구조를 보여줍니다. Double DQN의 온라인·타깃 network를 이용한 target 계산과 학습은 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"Double DQN 강화학습 구조 및 알고리즘입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_value_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/74c433521730433865cc9947","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"PointNet의 대표 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"Title; Fig. 2; §3; official charlesq34/pointnet repository","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/934f5fdbcfec19e7bf252598","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"반복 이웃 집계로 노드 표현을 갱신합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"§2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpm","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/generation"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"family":"generative","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/denoiser"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DDPM","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"DDPM","label":"DDPM","reference_year":2020,"runtime_id":"ddpm","runtime_note":"10-step noise schedule의 한 시점 forward noising과 시간 조건 U-Net의 잡음 예측. 전체 역확산 샘플링은 수행하지 않습니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"잡음을 점진적으로 제거하는 역과정을 학습하는 확산 생성 모델.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/denoising"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/diffusion"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/denoising"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d5a2dda84424d7197ad0791a","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/world_models"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_gate","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Retention output gate","label":"Retention output gate","summary":"retention 출력의 정보 흐름을 입력 의존적으로 조절합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fb1d308cd58673c39bb15771","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"HiPPO로 긴 과거의 기억을 보존하는 상태행렬을 초기화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"§2.2; §3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/s4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/hippo_memory"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d1b0c0541c245f783b374253","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"동일한 핵심을 병렬과 순환 형태로 평가할 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"§2.1–2.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_core"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/parallel_recurrent_equivalence"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/alphazero","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/alphazero"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"AlphaZero","label":"AlphaZero","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"alphazero_rl","runtime_note":"작은 공유 trunk와 정책 및 가치 head를 실행합니다. MCTS, 자기 대국, 원논문 residual CNN 및 학습은 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"AlphaZero 강화학습 구조 및 알고리즘입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_self_play"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/07b1d5abe1f75f0518e8b564","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"explanation":"스킬별 예측 가능한 전이를 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dads"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_skill_dynamics"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f08278fca0e0d1c9bab54724","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/decision_transformer"},"explanation":"인과 Transformer를 trajectory 모델링에 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/decision_transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/decision_transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/structured_state_space","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Structured state space","label":"Structured state space","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space"},"summary":"효율적이고 안정적인 시퀀스 계산을 위해 상태전이 행렬에 특별한 구조를 부여합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/nonlinear_projection","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Nonlinear projection head","label":"Nonlinear projection head","summary":"표현 인코더 뒤 학습 가능한 비선형 변환에서 자기지도 손실을 계산합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/450cec177469ce94a6e8683f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"Vision Transformer: 위치 표현 모듈.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/novel_view_synthesis","@type":"Task","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Novel-view synthesis","label":"Novel-view synthesis","summary":"알려진 카메라 영상으로 학습한 장면의 새 시점을 렌더링합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/world_models","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_dynamics"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"World Models","label":"World Models","reference_year":2018,"runtime_id":"world_models_rl","runtime_note":"작은 encoder, 결정론적 순환 memory, controller와 decoder를 실행합니다. VAE sampling, MDN-RNN의 mixture density, 진화 탐색과 환경은 생략합니다.","summary":"World Models 강화학습 구조 및 알고리즘입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_latent_imagination"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/nbeats_block_stack","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"N-BEATS block stack","label":"N-BEATS block stack","summary":"backcast residual과 partial forecast를 전달하는 fully connected block 집합입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/461e52eb6170c3ff8054b349","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"PointNet Fig. 2; §3–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/symmetric_reduction"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2f47c48c847dfd2d92063368","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"ViT 기반 인코더를 가시 패치에 적용하고 별도 디코더로 가려진 픽셀을 복원합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/pixel_predictor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e65b5ab385702fd5c583fb99","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"explanation":"과제와 상태 사이 상호정보량을 추구합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"relation":{"@id":"https://gi