I/p2i-kg#model/td3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neural_operator","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Neural operator","label":"Neural operator","summary":"유한 차원 벡터가 아니라 함수 공간 사이의 사상을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b49855253194c2e38ebb134f","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3129ad0a1c970cbafe79437f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"explanation":"LLaMA · 2023: SwiGLU.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/llama"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/swiglu"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0828df6586a779fc96cb2919","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"explanation":"block forecast가 전체 예측에 누적됩니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"locator":"§3.1, Eq.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nbeats"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/forecast_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/view_dependent_radian