/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/critical_point_selection"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c2629d09ec2553a748701456","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"explanation":"확률적 actor와 critic을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/sac"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8af2fa651b4f8eadaf9b6c60","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"},"explanation":"잠재 상태의 가치를 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/muzero"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2","@type":"Paper","author":["Tri Dao","Albert Gu"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Transformers are SSMs: Generalized Models and Efficient Algorithms Through Structured State Space Duality","label":"Transformers are SSMs: Generalized Models and Efficient Algorithms Through Structured State Space Duality","reference_year":2024,"summary":"구조화 상태공간 이중성으로 SSD와 Mamba-2를 도출한 원논문이며 state-spaces/mamba가 저자 공식 구현입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v235/dao24a.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/dd98978fd6eed699d5236a2d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/simclr","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"family":"self-supervised","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ssl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/contrastive_projector"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"SimCLR","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Simple Contrastive Learning of Representations","label":"SimCLR","reference_year":2020,"runtime_id":"simclr","runtime_note":"16×16 두 시점 배치를 공유하는 작은 CNN 인코더와 2층 투영 헤드로 처리합니다. 배치 4개의 NT-Xent를 제공하며 증강 생성·대규모 ResNet 학습·사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"같은 이미지의 두 강한 증강 시점을 공유 인코더와 투영 헤드로 처리하고 배치 내 음성 쌍과 대조합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/nt_xent"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/two_view_augmentation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/in_batch_negatives"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/nonlinear_projection"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_cross_attention","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Input-to-latent cross-attention","label":"Input-to-latent cross-attention","summary":"잠재 배열이 큰 입력 배열에서 정보를 읽어옵니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/asymmetric_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_skill_learning","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Unsupervised skill learning","label":"Unsupervised skill learning","summary":"외부 과제 보상 없이 다양한 행동 스킬을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/11f60be889fa096bcfc3bc8f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"원시 점구름 물체 분류에 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"Abstract; §4.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/point_cloud_classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1ceba9073520a97cf881cc77","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"hidden state를 다음-token logits로 투영합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/language_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/722ef8213cd7fe4028369194","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: 자기회귀 예측.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bf5abd38306aeefb1edb7c6b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: Transformer 디코더 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7d6a7369ff14ff014ccd1397","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/planet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_posterior"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/long_range_sequence","@type":"Task","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Long-range sequence modeling","label":"Long-range sequence modeling","summary":"매우 긴 시퀀스에서 멀리 떨어진 의존성을 예측하거나 분류합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/channel_scale","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Channel scale","label":"Channel scale","summary":"학습된 채널 gate를 원 특징 맵에 곱합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm","@type":"Paper","author":["Robin Rombach","Andreas Blattmann","Dominik Lorenz","Patrick Esser","Björn Ommer"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models","label":"High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models","reference_year":2022,"summary":"지각 압축 잠재공간에서 조건부 확산을 수행해 계산량과 충실도를 조절하는 LDM 원논문.","url":{"@id":"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Rombach_High-Resolution_Image_Synthesis_With_Latent_Diffusion_Models_CVPR_2022_paper.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/byol","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/simclr"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"family":"self-supervised","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/online_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/online_projector"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/online_predictor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/target_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/target_projector"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"BYOL","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Bootstrap Your Own Latent","label":"BYOL","reference_year":2020,"runtime_id":"byol","runtime_note":"16×16 두 시점을 온라인·표적 CNN 경로로 처리하고 온라인 전용 predictor와 stop-gradient 회귀 손실을 제공합니다. EMA 갱신 1회를 실행할 수 있으며 증강 생성·대규모 학습·사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"온라인 인코더·투영기·예측기가 EMA 표적 네트워크의 다른 시점 표현을 음성 쌍 없이 예측합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/byol_regression"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/two_view_augmentation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/nonlinear_projection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/momentum_target"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/stop_gradient"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/bootstrap_prediction"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a5c0adaba338eeaba1262dc7","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"점별 밀도·특징을 계산하는 완전연결 네트워크.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Fig.3; official run_nerf_helpers.py (init_nerf_model)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nerf"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/radiance_mlp"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Expected return maximization","label":"Expected return maximization","summary":"누적 보상의 기댓값을 높이는 정책을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Transformer","label":"Transformer","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"seq2seq","runtime_note":"작은 인코더–디코더 예제: 정현파 위치 인코딩, 인과적 디코더 마스크, 교차 어텐션을 포함합니다. 임의 초기화와 teacher forcing을 사용하며 번역 학습이나 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"Self-Attention과 FFN, 잔차 연결로 시퀀스 표현을 갱신합니다. 실행 예제는 위치 인코딩·인과적 마스크·교차 어텐션을 포함하는 작은 인코더–디코더이며, 논문의 학습된 전체 모델 재현은 아닙니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"U-Net","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"UNET","label":"U-Net","reference_year":2015,"runtime_id":"unet","runtime_note":"2단계 U-Net 축소 예제. encoder–decoder와 skip concatenation을 포함하며 padding으로 공간 크기를 보존합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"축소 경로와 확장 경로 사이 특징 연결을 이용한 영상 분할 모델.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/skip_connections"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/memory_cell","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"메모리 셀","label":"메모리 셀","summary":"LSTM에서 장기 정보를 전달하는 별도의 셀 상태를 사용합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/946875790716a66099ef3a23","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"explanation":"보상 없이 스킬을 발견합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dads"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_skill_discovery"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1d665034a1ddf21edfb7f194","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: 언어 이해.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/understanding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/66a25657bff6e53faf346d4f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/td3"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wa