http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/32a43a0e0ab282f7f2947f37","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/two_view_augmentation","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Two-view augmentation","label":"Two-view augmentation","summary":"한 표본에서 독립적으로 증강한 두 시점을 만들어 표현 일관성을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detection_heads","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Set detection heads","label":"Set detection heads","summary":"각 질의별 클래스 로짓과 정규화 상자를 예측합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5e9f3f6d502d84be12123fcb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"explanation":"잠재 상태의 가치를 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#