i-kg#claim/26986b5526f681e40207c75b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"explanation":"대표 참고 문헌입니다. 연도는 이 문헌 기준이며 모델 계열의 최초 발명 연도를 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/lstm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5c16a21363f56b1164a05980","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/actor_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_skill_dynamics","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Skill-conditioned dynamics","label":"Skill-conditioned dynamics","summary":"상태 변화가 선택한 스킬에 어떻게 의존하는지 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/stop_gradient","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Stop-gradient target","label":"Stop-gradient target","summary":"표적 표현 경로로 손실 기울기가 흐르지 않도록 차단합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/311f9d5786d6ba8b44d208e0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: Transformer 인코더 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9dfba1e7ceb7fbb791883b1f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"동일한 원소 변환을 집합 전체에 공유합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"§2–3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/deepsets"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shared_element_encoding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/pde_operator_learning","@type":"Task","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"PDE solution operator learning","label":"PDE solution operator learning","summary":"PDE의 계수·초기조건 함수에서 해 함수로 가는 연산자를 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5d96dc02aa878910625bf308","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"explanation":"residual layer의 이산 update를 연속시간 미분방정식으로 일반화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"locator":"§1–2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/neuralode"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4c547cfd96ea61839e276c9f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"정의와 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"Paper §2–3; official implementation modules","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"sou