:"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"Paper §2–4; official GraphSAGE modules","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/mean_aggregation"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bc5f44a55aad8dec2ce7b23a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"causal decay가 적용된 content aggregation 핵심입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"§2.1, Eq.7","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/retnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_core"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/10ca10182f976d1a7016b21c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"과제의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper Abstract, §4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/object_detection"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/graph_classification","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Graph classification","label":"Graph classification","summary":"전체 그래프를 하나의 범주로 분류합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ea8f0537f6065a34a6294a9f","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"Transformer의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fc26fdac968be7e46cd9bf1a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"대규모 자기회귀 언어 모델링에 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"Abstract; §3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/retnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv2"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_posterior"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_dynamics"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_reward"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DreamerV3","label":"DreamerV3","reference_year":2023,"runtime_id":"dreamerv3_rl","runtime_note":"작은 범주형 확률 잠재 표현과 symlog 입력, GRU 전이 및 정책·가치·보상 head를 실행합니다. 원본의 샘플링, 분포형 head, KL balancing, 정규화, 환경과 학습은 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"세계 모델, 상상 정책 학습과 정규화 기법을 결합해 다양한 과제에 적용합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_discrete_latent"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_symlog"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_latent_imagination"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3c3746d51fa69a17d5ff2475","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"SimCLR의 대조 표현 학습 설계입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"§2.2, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/simclr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/in_batch_negatives"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5c89836972043ff50aaddcc0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"시선 방향을 결합하는 RGB 출력 경로.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Fig.3; official run_nerf_helpers.py (inputs_viewdirs, RGB layers)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nerf"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/view_color_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/aa6d28644bfbd5022240a1b0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"explanation":"Variational Autoencoder: 변분 하한.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/elbo"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/270bb867c768bac07554e33d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/a3c"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1fa6f409a592ba896ceb2d9c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"탐지 슬롯을 정의하는 객체 질의 임베딩.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2; official models/detr.py (query_embed)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/detr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/object_queries"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5d425b0a380b52df4b7f17cc","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"보상을 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_reward"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/04456e10f47c0cc82b0de207","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: 패치 임베딩.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/51fe4ca19a31a9f24040be6b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"explanation":"게이트를 추가한 순환 유닛으로 비교합니다. LSTM의 단순한 후속 버전이라는 직선 계보를 뜻하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gru"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/transformer_denoiser","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Transformer denoiser","label":"Transformer denoiser","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/denoising"},"summary":"합성곱 U-Net 대신 잠재 패치 토큰의 Transformer가 확산 예측을 수행합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dynamic_dictionary","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Dynamic contrastive dictionary","label":"Dynamic contrastive dictionary","summary":"현재 표현 공간과 일관성을 유지하며 학습 중 갱신되는 대조 키 사전입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceiver","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"family":"multimodal","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_input_projection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_array"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_cross_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_processor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_classifier"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Perceiver","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Perceiver","label":"Perceiver","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"perceiver","runtime_note":"12개의 8차원 입력을 4개의 학습 잠재 벡터로 증류한 뒤 잠재 self-attention과 분류기를 실행합니다. 길이를 바꿔도 잠재 병목 크기는 고정되는 무작위 초기화 구조 예제입니다.","summary":"입력 크기와 독립적인 작은 잠재 배열이 비대칭 교차 어텐션으로 다양한 모달리티를 처리합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_bottleneck"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/asymmetric_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/modality_agnostic_input"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/nt_xent","@type":"Objective","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"NT-Xent contrastive loss","label":"NT-Xent contrastive loss","summary":"양성 시점 쌍의 정규화 유사도를 높이고 온도 조절된 배치 내 음성 쌍을 구별합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e092c648fe519668c00d4630","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"channel-mix block이 시점별 feature를 비선형 변환합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"§3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_mixing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_video_world_model","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Action-conditioned video world model","label":"Action-conditioned video world model","summary":"행동을 조건으로 미래 시각 관측을 모델링합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fb995442d474c5152a59904d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"MobileNet: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mobilenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d7bcd3812b070a1e477e4f95","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"explanation":"T5: Encoder–Decoder.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3ce9d6baf89e6c0ec5695583","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"explanation":"ConvNeXt: Depthwise 합성곱.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/convnext"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/depthwise"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/380996696299f8f7894d5356","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"연속 좌표에서 밀도와 방사 특징을 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Fig.3; official run_nerf_helpers.py (init_nerf_model)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/radiance_mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/radiance_field"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/08516a0d8ac5304525e4ada6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"ex