":"가치 함수를 추정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ppo"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bc4735969d690699ad044718","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"explanation":"Graph Convolutional Network: 노드 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c5454c0c364ca7c7e6cc015b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"대표 참고 문헌입니다. 연도는 이 문헌 기준이며 모델 계열의 최초 발명 연도를 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet","@type":"Paper","author":["Charles R. Qi","Hao Su","Kaichun Mo","Leonidas J. Guibas"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"PointNet: Deep Learning on Point Sets for 3D Classification and Segmentation","label":"PointNet: Deep Learning on Point Sets for 3D Classification and Segmentation","reference_year":2017,"summary":"정렬되지 않은 원시 점 집합을 공유 점 특징과 대칭 함수로 직접 처리하는 3D 분류·분할 아키텍처 원논문.","url":{"@id":"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Qi_PointNet_Deep_Learning_CVPR_2017_paper.html"}},{"@id"