#model/nerf"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/coordinate_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bbd9b545968d08994f16a149","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/direct_set_prediction"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/teacher_centering","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Teacher centering","label":"Teacher centering","summary":"교사 logits의 이동 중심을 제거해 자기증류의 붕괴를 억제합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/adf704152e0e8e9ed63689b7","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"상상된 경험으로 정책을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/75f0ada1780826e7209513c6","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"explanation":"결정적 정책과 action-value critic을 결합합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f157043f25fe2662108889d8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"공유 함수로 이웃을 표본화·집계하는 귀납 구조입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§2, Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tcn_temporal_blocks","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"TCN temporal block stack","label":"TCN temporal block stack","summary":"dilation이 증가하는 causal residual block의 순차 구성입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_q_head","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Action-value head","label":"Action-value head","summary":"특징으로 행동별 가치를 예측합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/74e95f19d95bbd60243e8a8c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"좌표와 방향을 log-spaced 사인·코사인 특징으로 확장합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §5.1, Eq.4; official run_nerf_helpers.py (Embedder, get_embedder)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nerf"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/fourier_features"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7845c90111a52ac532c434ff","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"영상 특징 추출용 합성곱 백본.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2; official models/detr.py (backbone, input_proj)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/detr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_backbone"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decision_aggregation","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"TabNet decision aggregation","label":"TabNet decision aggregation","summary":"여러 step에서 얻은 decision representation을 최종 출력으로 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/64db6075c7fcfbb95128852a","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"explanation":"순차 제어 또는 게임 의사결정에 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/double_dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c86268e8a937d4937347ade6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"정의와 구조적 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"SimCLR §2–3; official implementation","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/in_batch_negatives"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/neuralode","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"family":"continuous-depth","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ode_input_projection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neural_vector_field"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/differentiable_ode_solver"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ode_classifier"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Neural ODE","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Neural Ordinary Differential Equation","label":"Neural ODE","reference_year":2018,"runtime_id":"neuralode","runtime_note":"6차원 특징을 폭 12로 투영한 뒤 작은 자율 벡터장을 4회의 explicit Euler step으로 적분하고 분류합니다. adaptive solver, adjoint O(1)-memory 역전파, event handling과 continuous normalizing flow는 포함하지 않으며 solver 경계와 벡터장 학습을 보여주는 고정 예제입니다.","summary":"이산 층 대신 신경망 벡터장을 적분해 연속 깊이의 은닉 상태 변환을 정의하는 구조입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/continuous_depth"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neural_vector_field"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/differentiable_ode_solve"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2c0898e3d9d8d812b16156a0","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"논문의 입력 정렬 T-Net 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"Fig. 2; §3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/input_transform"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/02c994f76d13f1b42ca36bad","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/td3"},"explanation":"해당 개념을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/td3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/td3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5885f2fecf02f29ad910d546","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"학습 목적의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Eq.4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/photometric_mse"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/78eeb0dd6bafd3cd99ef89ac","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dueling_dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_value_stream"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"VGG","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"VGG","label":"VGG","reference_year":2014,"runtime_id":"vgg","runtime_note":"torchvision VGG11의 합성곱 스택. 1×1 풀링과 작은 분류기로 축소했습니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"작은 합성곱 커널을 반복하여 깊은 영상 특징을 학습합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/selective_state_space","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"선택적 상태 공간","label":"선택적 상태 공간","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space"},"summary":"상태 전이의 매개변수가 입력에 따라 달라지는 시퀀스 모델."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/adaln_modulation","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"adaLN modulation network","label":"adaLN modulation network","summary":"시간·클래스 조건에서 이동, 크기와 잔차 게이트 파라미터를 생성합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adaptive_layer_norm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/28f38868bcfac4694311984a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"},"explanation":"DQN을 소개합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9980bbe1069e558c980e2125","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/causal_mask"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_projection","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"GraphSAGE self projection","label":"GraphSAGE self projection","summary":"중심 노드 자체 특징을 공유 가중치로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5bca0d3ae0dbca817e81cde4","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"QKV 표현으로 retention 내용을 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"§2.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/retnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_qkv"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/17fe499a33974a80c2e9c944","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"두 경로는 교차 어텐션 없이 각각 자기 어텐션 블록으로 구성됩니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_decoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ssd_algorithm","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"State Space Dual algorithm","label":"State Space Dual algorithm","summary":"상태공간 이중성에 기반해 시퀀스를 블록 단위로 병렬 계산하는 핵심 알고리즘입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_value_stream","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Value stream","label":"Value stream","summary":"공유 특징에서 상태 가치 또는 가치 분포를 추정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7d39ae5e507871336c0bca22","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"실행 예제는 논문의 mean aggregator 변형을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§3.1; official aggregators.py MeanAggregator","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neighbor_aggregator"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/mean_aggregation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fa5cdf1fbf353f5aaa64c484","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rainbow"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/47bcabfc14742be41c9eed79","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"잠재 표현에 확산 순방향·역과정을 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ldm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/diffusion"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e7928253055ce89528ff7d8e","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"언어 모델링에서 Transformer와 비교합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"§8","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4a5ae234dc8e279d5cc08383","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"표현력을 WL 검정과 연결합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"Theorem 3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/wl_expressivity"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm","@type":"Paper","author":["Jonathan Ho","Ajay Jain","Pieter Abbeel"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models","label":"Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models","reference_year":2020,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1adc8bbf0273207b7260763b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"Transformer 구성 요소를 채택하고 입력·마스킹·학습 구성을 변경.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr","@type":"Paper","author":["Ting Chen","Simon Kornblith","Mohammad Norouzi","Geoffrey Hinton"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"A Simple Framework for Contrastive Learning of Visual Representations","label":"A Simple Framework for Contrastive Learning of Visual Representations","reference_year":2020,"summary":"강한 두 시점 증강, 공유 인코더, 비선형 투영 헤드와 NT-Xent를 결합한 SimCLR 원논문.","url":{"@id":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v119/chen20j.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fcdab0a12684d383ad264dc8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"연속시간 선형 상태공간으로 시퀀스를 모델링합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"§2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/s4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4be715b40b3a7e17e4490232","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"Transformer의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9851e5196e3975b5f3f36669","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"explanation":"선택적 상태 공간 갱신을 어텐션 기반 시퀀스 처리의 대안으로 제시.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#alternative_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0d9a08490aab4456f4fc5e6c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"RWKV의 병렬·순환 표현과 공식 구현의 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"Abstract; §3; BlinkDL/RWKV-LM","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/936ae4d2f453dabfa79e4ea4","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/alphazero","@type":"Paper","author":["David Silver","Thomas Hubert","Julian Schrittwieser","Ioannis Antonoglou","Matthew Lai","Arthur Guez","Marc Lanctot","Laurent Sifre","Dharshan Kumaran","Thore Graepel","Timothy Lillicrap","Karen Simonyan","Demis Hassabis"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mastering Chess and Shogi by Self-Play with a General Reinforcement Learning Algorithm","label":"Mastering Chess and Shogi by Self-Play with a General Reinforcement Learning Algorithm","reference_year":2017,"summary":"AlphaZero의 대표 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1712.01815"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c215acdff8fbff2a22897336","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"explanation":"비지도 스킬 발견에 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_skill_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_lifting","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"FNO lifting layer","label":"FNO lifting layer","summary":"입력 함수와 좌표를 높은 채널 폭으로 올립니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3f1fdec37de043cd00209e92","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"상대 위치에 따른 복소 위상과 감쇠를 retention에 포함합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"§2.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/retnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mamba2_input_projection","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mamba-2 input projection","label":"Mamba-2 input projection","summary":"입력을 SSD 내용 경로와 출력 gate 경로로 분리합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f08e1c2601d89d660af07502","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"원 논문의 인코더/디코더 블록 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/point_segmentation","@type":"Task","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Point-wise segmentation","label":"Point-wise segmentation","summary":"점구름의 각 점에 부분 또는 의미 범주를 할당합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ecedacdae497f2bea7e15a58","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"explanation":"모멘텀 교사 backbone입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"locator":"Fig.2; official teacher_without_ddp","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/teacher_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/image_encoder","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상 인코더","label":"영상 인코더","summary":"영상을 비교 가능한 표현 공간으로 변환.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ddb6330fb7fe8343aebcf1b5","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"explanation":"학생과 중심화·sharpening 교사 분포를 맞춥니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"locator":"Eq.3; DINOLoss","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/dino_self_distillation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/491f7b7308ee2b951c1ead2b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: 잔차 연결.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tcn","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/sequence_modeling"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"temporal-convolution","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tcn_temporal_blocks"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/dilated_causal_convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tcn_residual_path"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tcn_sequence_head"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Temporal Convolutional Network","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"TCN","label":"Temporal Convolutional Network","reference_year":2018,"runtime_id":"tcn","runtime_note":"길이 16·특징 4의 sequence에 dilation 1·2·4인 세 causal residual block과 마지막 시점 분류 head를 적용합니다. 원논문의 weight normalization, dropout, benchmark별 깊이와 긴 학습 설정은 제외한 구조 검증용 고정 예제입니다.","summary":"팽창 인과 합성곱과 residual block을 쌓아 긴 수용 영역을 병렬적으로 처리하는 sequence model입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dilated_causal_convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/temporal_receptive_field"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual_sequence_modeling"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/34dec9ff1b51d8bad17f1052","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"시퀀스 전체에 적용할 SSM kernel을 생성합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"§3.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_state_kernel"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space_kernel"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9995ff1d86dedf055f2dbff5","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"explanation":"Mamba: 자기회귀 예측.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2e9c4db46b7a1d83beaf3c91","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"explanation":"LLaMA · 2023: Feed-forward 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/llama"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/mean_aggregation","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mean neighborhood aggregation","label":"Mean neighborhood aggregation","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sample_and_aggregate"},"summary":"이웃 특징을 순서 불변 평균으로 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/019b0df231d437486535c5f3","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"잠재공간의 조건부 노이즈 예측 목적을 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3.1, Eq.1; §3.3, Eq.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ldm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/latent_denoising"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/language_head","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Language-model head","label":"Language-model head","summary":"시퀀스 hidden state를 다음-token vocabulary logits로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4a80b9a6b5f2c8fd4fe92490","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"BYOL의 음성 쌍 없는 부트스트랩 설계입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"§2, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/byol"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/momentum_target"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/800beeaf3fdf436dc39e2f62","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"교차 시점의 온라인 예측과 표적 투영을 대칭적으로 맞춥니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"§2, Eq.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/byol"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/byol_regression"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c221bbda2cc28c57badce0ad","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"공식 모델은 합성곱 백본 특징을 Transformer 차원으로 투영합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2; official models/detr.py (backbone, input_proj)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_backbone"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b741bc49772a0004a84dcde6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/actor_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6e42fd545a0a35421d230d5c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"explanation":"잠재 공간에서 정책과 가치 모델을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a294b26e64077a1974ada25d","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"explanation":"순차 제어 또는 게임 의사결정에 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/world_models"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/313bc051b38cac3310777ef9","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"explanation":"local linear transform을 spectral path와 더합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"locator":"§3.1, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/fno"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_local_path"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/fno","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/pde_operator_learning"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"neural-operator","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_lifting"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/spectral_convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_local_path"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_projection"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Fourier Neural Operator","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"FNO","label":"Fourier Neural Operator","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"fno","runtime_note":"길이 32의 1차원 scalar field와 좌표를 폭 8로 lifting하고 6개 Fourier mode의 spectral convolution과 pointwise local path를 결합해 출력장을 예측합니다. 원논문의 2D/3D PDE 데이터, 여러 FNO block, resolution transfer 학습과 production neuraloperator 구현은 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"저주파 Fourier mode의 학습된 전역 convolution으로 함수 공간 사이의 해 연산자를 근사합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neural_operator"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/fourier_operator"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/resolution_invariance"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/792b1211d1e34a8d6fffe0d6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"locator":"Paper §2, Fig.1; https://github.com/google-research/vision_transformer/blob/main/vit_jax/models_mixer.py (MixerBlock, MlpMixer)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/channel_mixer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c21d871494b2b0821e484303","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"},"explanation":"Atari 및 보드 게임에서 행동을 선택합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/muzero"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d556942d76731bba7c40072b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"ViT 기반 인코더를 가시 패치에 적용하고 별도 디코더로 가려진 픽셀을 복원합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/dc4b93ac6168a108efc37225","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"explanation":"스킬 조건부 정책을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/contrastive","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상–텍스트 대조 목적","label":"영상–텍스트 대조 목적","summary":"배치 내 영상과 텍스트의 대응을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_projection","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"FNO projection layer","label":"FNO projection layer","summary":"숨은 함수 표현을 목표 출력장으로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0dcf19a07ab1818f6c10e8eb","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"정책 최적화에 사용되는 가치 추정 경로입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/target_projector","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"BYOL target projector","label":"BYOL target projector","summary":"표적 인코더 표현을 회귀 표적으로 변환하는 이동 평균 투영기입니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/momentum_target"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_reward","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Reward predictor","label":"Reward predictor","summary":"잠재 상태에서 보상을 추정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ab14ec0e0eabba77ac7bd592","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"explanation":"환경에서 장기 성과를 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/world_models"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dqn","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_q_head"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DQN","label":"DQN","reference_year":2013,"runtime_id":"dqn_rl","runtime_note":"8차원 상태를 입력해 네 행동의 Q값을 출력하는 임의 초기화 MLP입니다. Atari CNN, 경험 재생, target network 및 학습 루프는 실행하지 않습니다.","summary":"신경망으로 상태별 행동 가치를 추정하는 가치 기반 강화학습 에이전트입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_value_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c3784070dc8b9a7db73704fc","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"explanation":"Atari와 시각 제어에 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8e61d999157bd7547ecd7d08","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rainbow"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_advantage_stream"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/41f0e7912a6fd3c2b9174a07","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"explanation":"Option-Critic 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/option_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/36d2064c5fbf0c8eaad15f21","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"explanation":"환경에서 장기 성과를 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/a3c"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/93582f8c325a744a90dc2b89","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"SSM과 구조화 attention 행렬의 이중성을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"§3–5","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space_duality"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/channel_mixer","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Channel-mixing MLP","label":"Channel-mixing MLP","summary":"채널 축에 적용되는 두 Linear와 GELU.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_mixing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1636e3cdea3530cebf8a74ea","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"입력 투영 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"§7; official mamba2.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mamba2_input_projection"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mobilenet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"MobileNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"MOBILENET","label":"MobileNet","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"mobilenet","runtime_note":"2017년 MobileNet V1의 depthwise·pointwise convolution과 원래 단계 구성을 포함한 width multiplier 0.25 예제입니다. 32×32 입력·4종 분류이며 가중치는 무작위 초기화입니다.","summary":"Depthwise와 pointwise 연산을 분리한 경량 합성곱 구조.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/depthwise"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/separable_convolution"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/image_text","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상–텍스트 연결","label":"영상–텍스트 연결","summary":"영상과 자연어 표현의 의미적 대응을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_classifier","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Graph classifier","label":"Graph classifier","summary":"그래프 수준 표현을 클래스 logits로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a4cc593b46f1b334bedfbd71","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"Vision Transformer: 영상 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/56767e593f5191724146f143","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"explanation":"prior와 processed features에서 feature mask를 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"locator":"§3.1, Eq.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tabnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/attentive_transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/943cbdd7b911c9e6fb4ff62f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/pixel_predictor"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/spectral_convolution","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Spectral convolution","label":"Spectral convolution","summary":"선택된 Fourier mode에 학습된 복소 선형 변환을 적용합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/fourier_operator"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/reinforce","@type":"Paper","author":"Ronald J. Williams","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Simple statistical gradient-following algorithms for connectionist reinforcement learning","label":"Simple statistical gradient-following algorithms for connectionist reinforcement learning","reference_year":1992,"summary":"REINFORCE의 대표 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00992696"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/28c403d18a4f4fc9120f9bda","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/td3"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/td3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/td3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_q_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/byol_regression","@type":"Objective","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"BYOL symmetric prediction loss","label":"BYOL symmetric prediction loss","summary":"두 방향에서 정규화한 온라인 예측과 stop-gradient 표적 투영의 거리를 줄입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/36c556f3e48faf66503485eb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"explanation":"Mamba: 언어 모델링.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7c2cc3e317a4e9bc83053911","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"정규화 표현의 온도 조절 대조 목적을 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"§2.2, Eq.1; official objective.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/simclr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/nt_xent"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1c3cb1d7c7a12f1a107c223a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"explanation":"T5: 상대 위치 표현.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/input_transform","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Point input transform","label":"Point input transform","summary":"PointNet의 학습 가능한 변환망이 입력 점 또는 특징을 정렬합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/input_alignment"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multiscale","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"다중 스케일 처리","label":"다중 스케일 처리","summary":"서로 다른 수용 영역과 해상도의 특징을 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d1bc0c7ee380c874c0034583","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/planet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/perceptual_compression","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Perceptual compression","label":"Perceptual compression","summary":"생성에 중요한 정보를 보존하면서 고주파 세부를 제거하는 학습된 압축 공간을 사용합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/18993f79e2f2c07711f1fbcf","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/visible_patch_encoding"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/45a721ef74390da551e40afa","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: 위치 정보.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_decoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DETR Transformer decoder","label":"DETR Transformer decoder","summary":"객체 질의가 인코더 메모리를 교차 어텐션으로 조회합니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_patch_embed","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Latent patch embedding","label":"Latent patch embedding","summary":"공간 잠재를 고정 크기 패치 토큰 시퀀스로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9c30c5276fd8cdc8a52b8726","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"공유 점 함수가 고차원 특징을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"Fig. 2; §3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet"},"target":{"@id