":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/912cc5d07609215e12355b09","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"GraphSAGE-mean 실행 경로의 실제 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§4; official graphsage/supervised_models.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/node_classifier"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d531fff49e340bd9af1e4ef8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"},"explanation":"행동별 Q값을 추정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_value_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/s4","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/long_range_sequence"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"family":"state-space","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_input_projection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_state_kernel"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_normalization"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"S4","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Structured State Space sequence model","label":"S4","reference_year":20