 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://cdn.openai.com/better-language-models/language_models_are_unsupervised_multitask_learners.pdf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/adversarial","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"적대적 목적","label":"적대적 목적","summary":"생성자와 판별자의 경쟁 목적을 최적화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3f829a2d4a00fd07c97fe12f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"Deep Sets §2–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/set_learning"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e3fd501e8f21dbec69ab438f","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"explanation":"dense feature transformation에 sequential attentive selection을 추가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tabnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2f60797bc11efd070375de89","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"구조적 역할의 원문과 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3; autoencoder.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/first_stage_decoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"}},