eb26a0fd5f33c2da21c16b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"정의와 구조적 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"BYOL §2; official byol_experiment.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/bootstrap_prediction"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a0129c0a95cc0dabf4d151a2","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"explanation":"상태 특징을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/aps"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4c33d998be6c9122a8842f24","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"RNN의 고정 상태 순환 추론을 병렬 학습 가능한 WKV 형태로 확장합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/unseen_node_representation"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"family":"graph","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neighbor_aggregator"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_projection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neighbor_projection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/node_classifier"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"GraphSAGE","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":["Graph SAGE","Sample and Aggregate"],"label":"GraphSAGE","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"graphsage","runtime_note":"5개 노드의 전체 이웃 평균을 사용해 표본화 변동을 없앤 GraphSAGE-mean 한 층 예제입니다. 자체·이웃 변환과 노드 분류기를 별도 P2I 모듈로 노출합니다.","summary":"노드 자체 특징과 표본화한 이웃 특징의 학습 가능한 집계 함수로 보지 못한 노드의 표현을 생성합니다.","trained_with":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/graph_context_prediction"}],"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/inductive_graph_learning"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neighborhood_sampling"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/mean_aggregation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sample_and_aggregate"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ssd_core","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"SSD core","label":"SSD core","summary":"구조화 상태공간 이중성의 recurrent 또는 chunked 병렬 핵심 변환입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fef8feafa7c2bc65a7451111","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"explanation":"초기값 문제를 계산 그래프 안에서 풉니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"locator":"Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/differentiable_ode_solver"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/differentiable_ode_solve"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage","@type":"Paper","author":["William L. Hamilton","Rex Ying","Jure Leskovec"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Inductive Representation Learning on Large Graphs","label":"Inductive Representation Learning on Large Graphs","reference_year":2017,"summary":"이웃 특징을 표본화하고 집계하는 함수로 보지 못한 노드의 표현을 생성하는 GraphSAGE 원논문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.02216"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/547bc8a5e3fe2e58ab5f4ba3","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"GIN의 원논문과 저자 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"§4–5; official powerful-gnns models/graphcnn.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c","@type":"Paper","author":["Volodymyr Mnih","Adria Puigdomenech Badia","Mehdi Mirza","Alex Graves","Timothy Lillicrap","Tim Harley","David Silver","Koray Kavukcuoglu"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Asynchronous Methods for Deep Reinforcement Learning","label":"Asynchronous Methods for Deep Reinforcement Learning","reference_year":2016,"summary":"A3C의 대표 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1602.01783"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin","@type":"Paper","author":["Keyulu Xu","Weihua Hu","Jure Leskovec","Stefanie Jegelka"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"How Powerful are Graph Neural Networks?","label":"How Powerful are Graph Neural Networks?","reference_year":2019,"summary":"WL 검정과 동등한 표현력을 갖는 injective sum-aggregation GIN을 제안한 원논문이며 weihua916/powerful-gnns가 저자 공식 구현입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://openreview.net/forum?id=ryGs6iA5Km"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/157e7d01956c202322a977ec","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"