umented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"PointNet Fig. 2; §3–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/symmetric_max_pool"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8d7c18ac634ef1679651b459","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"explanation":"학습된 derivative function을 구현합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"locator":"§2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neural_vector_field"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neural_vector_field"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/densenet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DenseNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"DENSENET","label":"DenseNet","reference_year":2016,"runtime_id":"densenet","runtime_note":"각 블록 1층·growth rate 8로 축소한 torchvision DenseNet. 특징 연결과 전이층을 유지합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"이전 층의 특징을 연결하여 재사용하는 합성곱 네트워크.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dense_connections"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode","@type":"Paper","author":["Ricky T. Q. Chen","Yulia Rubanova","Jesse Bettencourt","David Duvenaud"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Neural Ordinary Differential Equations","label":"Neural Ordinary Differential Equations","reference_year":2018,"summary":"은닉 상태의 연속시간 미분을 신경망으로 매개변수화하고 미분방정식 solver로 출력을 계산하는 Neural ODE 원논문이며 rtqichen/torchdiffeq가 저자 공식 구현입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://papers.neurips.cc/paper/7892-neural-ordinary-differential-equations"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Feed-forward 블록","label":"Feed-forward 블록","summary":"각 위치의 채널 표현을 변환.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae","@type":"Paper","author":["Kaiming He","Xinlei Chen","Saining Xie","Yanghao Li","Piotr Dollár","Ross Girshick"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Masked Autoencoders Are Scalable Vision Learners","label":"Masked Autoencoders Are Scalable Vision Learners","reference_year":2021,"summary":"보이는 패치 인코더와 가벼운 복원 디코더를 사용하는 마스킹 기반 사전학습.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.06377"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/47b9c13f2f5b777eaf4cf9a6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"explanation":"GAN: 잠재 변수.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gan"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rotary_position","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RoPE","label":"RoPE","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},"summary":"벡터 회전을 이용해 위치에 따른 관계를 어텐