i-kg#model/decision_transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_action_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_mixing","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Channel mixing MLP","label":"Channel mixing MLP","summary":"각 패치에 같은 MLP를 적용하여 채널 정보를 혼합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6dc5337af1c82238c4e24356","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"원논문과 공식 구현에 대응하는 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"§2.1; official perceiver.py InputPreprocessor","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceiver"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_input_projection"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/retention_qkv","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Retention QKV projection","label":"Retention QKV projection","summary":"retention의 query, key, value 표현을 생성합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6b1de74ffee6c2b6b5ade8cf","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"},"explanation":"MuZero를 소개합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/muzero"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/muzero"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ca4ffb2668472a52c3c18c7a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"SE block을 합성곱 특징 계층에 삽입합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/pro