el/planet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e34bfb9a233f271529eb157d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"retention의 세 계산 형태와 RetNet의 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"Abstract; §2–3; microsoft/torchscale","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/retnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/planet"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_posterior"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_dynamics"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_critic"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_reward"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_decoder"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Dreamer","label":"Dreamer","reference_year":2019,"runtime_id":"dreamer_rl","runtime_note":"작은 관측 인코더, 결정론적 GRU 기반 상태 전이, 두 단계의 상상 rollout, 보상·가치·복원 head와 actor를 실행합니다. 원논문의 확률적 RSSM, 이미지 모델, replay와 학습 목적을 구현한 재현 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"잠재 세계 모델이 상상한 궤적에서 정책과 가치 함수를 학습하는 model-based RL입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_latent_imagination"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bab0bf9fa085019c691fc406","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"행동의 장기 보상을 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3b84287e8e7e0f6802b103a2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"explanation":"VGG: 가중치 공유.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cf5d0cd411afa17dac26a25c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"explanation":"패치 기반 분류에서 어텐션 대신 토큰·채널 MLP 혼합을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"locator":"Paper §2, Fig.1; https://github.com/google-research/vision_transformer/blob/main/vit_jax/models_mixer.py (MixerBlock, MlpMixer)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mixer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/token_mixer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual_sequence_modeling","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Residual temporal stack","label":"Residual temporal stack","summary":"temporal block의 변환과 입력 경로를 더해 깊은 sequence model을 안정화합니다."},{"@id":"ht