//github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/59a0e854692a898d5deeee23","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"구조화된 상태행렬로 kernel을 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_state_kernel"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/structured_state_space"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dads","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_skill_learning"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_dynamics"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DADS","label":"DADS","reference_year":2019,"runtime_id":"dads_rl","runtime_note":"상태와 연속 스킬을 입력받는 소형 정책 및 스킬 조건부 전이 예측기를 실행합니다. 원논문의 확률적 전이 밀도, 보상 계산, MPC 및 학습은 생략합니다.","summary":"스킬 조건부 동역학과 정책으로 예측 가능한 스킬을 발견합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_skill_diversity"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_skill_discovery"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_skill_dynamics"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_state_kernel","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"S4 state-space kernel","label":"S4 state-space kernel","summary":"구조화 상태전이, 입력·출력 벡터와 이산화로 장거리 혼합을 계산합니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/structured_state_space"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space_kernel"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/88feb852ca7487ab2a660e12","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"explanation":"교사 출력의 center를 이동 평균으로 보정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/teacher_centering"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/61a53a93744b54963d011d7b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"explanation":"GRU의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gru"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/eeede1164b336b94e5853e78","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/fourier_features","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Fourier position features","label":"Fourier position features","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},"summary":"좌표를 여러 주파수의 사인·코사인 성분으로 확장합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/20a33556cc87928b8b3afd4d","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"SSD block decomposition으로 병렬 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"§6, Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ssd_algorithm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/online_projector","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"BYOL online projector","label":"BYOL online projector","summary":"온라인 표현을 자기지도 표적 공간으로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6ef00c63758c7ec996812776","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.1, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/bipartite_matching"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/radiance_mlp","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Radiance-field point MLP","label":"Radiance-field point MLP","summary":"인코딩된 위치에서 밀도와 시점 비의존 특징을 계산합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/radiance_field"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/66f20f68f660af5c9efc0fd1","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"explanation":"대표 참고 문헌입니다. 연도는 이 문헌 기준이며 모델 계열의 최초 발명 연도를 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/density_head","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Volume-density head","label":"Volume-density head","summary":"공간 표본의 부피 밀도를 예측합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/token_mixer","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Token-mixing MLP","label":"Token-mixing MLP","summary":"패치 축에 적용되는 두 Linear와 GELU.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/token_mixing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/18565db2e726f470462b9de9","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"explanation":"U-Net: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ce0564c17b57d97d828022a0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: 위치별 FFN.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fca1241b58edda4d2f291054","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"MobileNet: 지도 분류 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mobilenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8fde06a4bf7433e395c630e3","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"각 DiT 블록은 다중 헤드 self-attention을 포함합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3; official DiTBlock.attn","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Self-Attention 블록","label":"Self-Attention 블록","summary":"동일 시퀀스 내부의 문맥 결합.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8b12cc72d66315348d0f81ff","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"explanation":"연속 깊이 dynamics를 수치적으로 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"locator":"§2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/differentiable_ode_solve"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/continuous_depth"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f01ee87f12478aae4e0b89b0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@i