PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/567c26ac734f52cb488713e6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"explanation":"여러 감쇠율을 병렬 head로 결합한 retention입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet"},"locator":"§2.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multi_scale_retention"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/retention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/783b565b15eb9ba453ccdc3e","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"ImageNet 분류 감독학습으로 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/senet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_input_projection","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Perceiver input projection","label":"Perceiver input projection","summary":"입력 특징을 잠재 배열과 같은 채널 폭으로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/29297b1795fe7ea6edaabb0a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"explanation":"Rainbow는 dueling 구조를 포함합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rainbow"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dueling_dqn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_successor_features","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Successor feature predictor","label":"Successor feature predictor","summary":"상태·행동·과제 조건에서 후속 특징을 추정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/462430dd2ceb1fa00256a4c2","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/double_dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_q_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/70a87f79a4fe0de4e0a2e49e","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"Deep Sets §2–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/permutation_invariance"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/option_critic","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/option_critic"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_option_values"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_option_policies"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_option_termination"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Option-Critic","label":"Option-Critic","reference_year":2016,"runtime_id":"option_critic_rl","runtime_note":"공유 인코더와 4개 옵션의 가치, 옵션별 3개 행동 logits 및 종료 확률 head를 실행합니다. 옵션 선택, gradient loss와 환경 상호작용은 생략합니다.","summary":"옵션별 정책과 종료 함수, 옵션 가치 추정을 함께 다룹니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_temporal_options"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/21047097bf72bf1d423784c2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"explanation":"패치 기반 분류에서 어텐션 대신 토큰·채널 MLP 혼합을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"locator":"Paper §2, Fig.1; https://github.com/google-research/vision_transformer/blob/main/vit_jax/models_mixer.py (MixerBlock, MlpMixer)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mixer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/channel_mixer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8e61753d75405fd44a2b5971","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"평탄화한 영상 특징을 처리하는 인코더.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2; official models/transformer.py (TransformerEncoder)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/detr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fed9d6384ce6f6c12c791a30","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"Deep Sets §2–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sum_decomp