206","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"그래프 readout 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"Eq.4.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_sum_pool"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cfaa9eb68c36ec07cc381fd4","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"정의와 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"Paper §2–4; official GraphSAGE modules","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/unseen_node_representation"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3b8cafd4c3dcea14c69dbe6e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"explanation":"합성곱 모델 계열의 구체적인 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/aps","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_skill_learning"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"