c41a126","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"보지 못한 노드의 분류 벤치마크에서 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"Abstract; §4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c080ca0c8d3f6196142f7284","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"과제의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper Abstract, §6","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/novel_view_synthesis"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron","@type":"Paper","author":"Frank Rosenblatt","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"The perceptron: A probabilistic model for information storage and organization in the brain","label":"The perceptron: A probabilistic model for information storage and organization in the brain","reference_year":1958,"summary":"모델과 개념을 설명하는 대표 문헌입니다. 원문에서 해당 구조와 주장 범위를 확인할 수 있습니다.","url":{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1037/h0042519"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/generation"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"family":"generative","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_decoder"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Variational Autoencoder","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLa