":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/decision_transformer"},"explanation":"causal Transformer가 trajectory를 처리합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/decision_transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/decision_transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_causal_transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3f9c3d038e66ecd602051220","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"explanation":"APS 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/aps"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8b4fa08b03d4947ae6286a9f","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"}],"explanation":"상태에서 스킬을 분류하는 대신 스킬에 조건부인 전이를 모델링합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dads"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"}],"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#alternative_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dads"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/907a4ccb4272b54542af465b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"표본별 색·밀도를 누적 투과도로 합성해 광선 색을 얻습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Eq.3; official run_nerf.py (raw2outputs)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nerf"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/volume_rendering"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e454a91d3d964038ebdf1d08","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"explanation":"block의 기본 계산은 fully connected ReLU stack입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nbeats"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/nbeats_block_mlp"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"CNN · LeNet 계열","label":"CNN · LeNet 계열","reference_year":1998,"runtime_id":"cnn","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"지역적 필터와 가중치 공유를 이용해 영상의 패턴을 추출합니다. 대표 문헌은 LeNet 계열이며 실행 예제는 P2I의 작은 CNN입니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/96abb75050b19d61954640d0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"비선형 MLP에서 대조 손실을 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"§2; §3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/contrastive_projector"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/nonlinear_projection"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg","@type":"Paper","author":["Timothy Lillicrap","Jonathan Hunt","Alexander Pritzel","Nicolas Heess","Tom Erez","Yuval Tassa","David Silver","Daan Wierstra"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Continuous Control with Deep Reinforcement Learning","label":"Continuous Control with Deep Reinforcement Learning","reference_year":2015,"summary":"DDPG의 대표 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1509.02971"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fa8ebd4d6afe4298afabbe84","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"},"explanation":"Atari 행동 선택에 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/661a4f503653a4b8b9b72427","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"표적 경로는 역전파에서 분리됩니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"§2, Eq.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/target_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/stop_gradient"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b9a34076a79b876cd8c3b035","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"SE-ResNet은 residual block에 채널 재보정을 추가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"§3.3; Fig.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/senet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5ded8eb826851c5c94701e4f","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"SSD 출력의 입력 의존 gate입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"§7; official gated RMSNorm path","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mamba2_output_gate"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/54849df2600f51aa2494b65d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"MobileNet: 합성곱.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mobilenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/tabular_prediction","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Tabular prediction","label":"Tabular prediction","summary":"수치·범주형 열로 구성된 표의 행에 대해 분류 또는 회귀를 수행합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/first_stage_encoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"First-stage image encoder","label":"First-stage image encoder","summary":"이미지를 확산이 실행되는 공간 잠재 표현으로 압축합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/70c9af5fa6f686e6b37ce205","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"관측을 인코딩합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_recalibration","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Channel recalibration","label":"Channel recalibration","summary":"입력 특징의 전역 문맥으로 채널별 중요도를 추정해 응답을 재가중합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/86c26fc399e0b9c4899b5630","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"explanation":"momentum key encoder 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"locator":"Eq.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/key_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/93360ba2504c2b665c4a2322","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"확산 시간을 Transformer 조건 벡터로 변환합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3; official TimestepEmbedder","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/diffusion_time_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/742f07800d19a1902d67b6bd","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ae8674e5a95f335539ce5583","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"explanation":"실행 예제는 이산 스킬을 조건 벡터로 변환합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/td3","@type":"Paper","author":["Scott Fujimoto","Herke van Hoof","David Meger"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Addressing Function Approximation Error in Actor-Critic Methods","label":"Addressing Function Approximation Error in Actor-Critic Methods","reference_year":2018,"summary":"TD3의 대표 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v80/fujimoto18a.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"어텐션","label":"어텐션","summary":"질의와 문맥에 따라 정보의 결합 가중치를 정하는 메커니즘."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/point_forecasting","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Point forecasting loss","label":"Point forecasting loss","summary":"미래 시계열 값의 point prediction과 정답 사이 오차를 최소화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_action_embedding","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Action embedding","label":"Action embedding","summary":"과거 행동을 토큰으로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/802a6ab8f99ea2b282eaaac0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"연속 5D 좌표를 밀도와 시점 의존 RGB로 매핑합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/