rivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"Deep Sets §2–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shared_element_encoding"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/temporal_receptive_field","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Temporal receptive field","label":"Temporal receptive field","summary":"sequence output 하나에 영향을 주는 과거 입력 구간의 범위입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fd1409bdb3acd4a80d64e305","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"Mamba-2/SSD의 원논문과 저자 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"§6–7; official state-spaces/mamba mamba2.py and ssd_combined.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7e682e0aa0b452a62038a246","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"explanation":"은닉 상태를 연속시간 ODE의 해로 정의합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode"},"locator":"§1–2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/neuralode"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/continuous_depth"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e74b68c52803b7d4b5c0d03c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"정의와 구조적 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"SimCLR §2–3; official implementation","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ssl_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5e1e6ce71d68cb022e4ac173","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"explanation":"해당 개념을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/double_dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/double_dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_value_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/62bf87204abebaafad9f5bf2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"explanation":"GAN: 자료 생성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gan"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/generation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2f220cb8b25689ed3d6635e2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 어텐션.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/swiglu","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"SwiGLU","label":"SwiGLU","summary":"SiLU를 이용한 게이트가 있는 feed-forward 활성화."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_encoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"MAE visible encoder","label":"MAE visible encoder","summary":"전체 중 보이는 패치의 Transformer 인코더.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/02d2fbf6545cc7a989d92e26","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"explanation":"정책을 매개변수화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ppo"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f0e4861b0885737405c1d69a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"원논문과 공식 구현에 대응하는 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"§3; official perceiver.py classification decoder","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceiver"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/perceiver_classifier"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c4c19f06a2102e5b4fc67cd6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"explanation":"DDPM: 노이즈 제거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/denoising"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sequential_feature_attention","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Sequential feature attention","label":"Sequential feature attention","summary":"여러 decision step이 이전 선택을 반영해 다음 표 특성 mask를 계산합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e287f9e8659ad3d22ff5e310","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"ResNet의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/44f7d0f7b78046c0ec518f9a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: 영상 분할.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1af091b3385d2836d54b650d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"공유 함수로 이웃을 표본화·집계하는 귀납 구조입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/mean_aggregation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_encoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DETR Transformer encoder","label":"DETR Transformer encoder","summary":"공간 특징 사이의 전역 문맥을 자기 어텐션으로 인코딩합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"family":"vision","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/patches"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Vision Transformer","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"VIT","label":"Vision Transformer","reference_year":2020,"runtime_id":"vit","runtime_note":"작은 실제 TorchVision ViT 구성. 패치·위치 임베딩을 포함하며 임의 초기화입니다.","summary":"영상 패치를 토큰으로 변환하여 Transformer 인코더로 처리합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac","@type":"Paper","author":["Tuomas Haarnoja","Aurick Zhou","Pieter Abbeel","Sergey Levine"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Soft Actor-Critic: Off-Policy Maximum Entropy Deep Reinforcement Learning with a Stochastic Actor","label":"Soft Actor-Critic: Off-Policy Maximum Entropy Deep Reinforcement Learning with a Stochastic Actor","reference_year":2018,"summary":"최대 엔트로피 off-policy actor–critic을 제안합니다.","url":{"@id":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v80/haarnoja18b.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b666d3bd7e7f3f58ed4a7709","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"explanation":"온라인 전용 예측기가 표적 투영을 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"locator":"§2, Fig.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/online_predictor"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/bootstrap_prediction"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d1497325fb2cfd450f1e4a17","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"explanation":"LLaMA · 2023: Self-Attention 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/llama"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2fa6e0928c6ea0d2e7e1aba6","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"explanation":"해당 개념을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/a3c"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/a3c"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ea10b2242027ef9da58551b3","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"세계 모델 안에서 강화학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e3693ee90a130c72a86b7d08","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"explanation":"합성곱 모델 계열의 구체적인 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/densenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3a414f393c6529261bca03bf","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"gated channel projection을 수행합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"§3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rwkv_channel_mix"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4f193db03e41b40244280be2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"새 노드와 완전히 새 그래프에 표현 함수를 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"Abstract; §1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/unseen_node_representation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9c974c8c04739f90bca5fb55","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"잠재 패치 토큰 사이의 전역 상호작용을 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/adaln_block"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/visual_representation"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"family":"vision","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/pixel_predictor"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Masked Autoencoder (MAE)","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Masked Autoencoders","label":"Masked Autoencoder (MAE)","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"mae","runtime_note":"16개 패치 중 4개만 인코딩, 한 층 인코더/디코더. 고정 75% 마스크와 위치 버퍼, masked-pixel MSE를 쓰는 작은 예제. CLS 토큰과 공식 sin-cos 위치값은 생략합니다.","summary":"마스킹된 패치를 인코더에서 제외하고 디코더에서 원래 순서로 복원합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/masked_pixel_mse"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/visible_patch_encoding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/masked_pixel_reconstruction"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5e83ba81d8a59003060e184a","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/reinforce"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/reinforce"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/reinforce"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mixer","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"family":"vision","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/token_mixer"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/channel_mixer"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"MLP-Mixer","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"MLP Mixer","label":"MLP-Mixer","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"mixer","runtime_note":"16×16 이미지, 4×4 패치, 한 Mixer 블록. 무작위 초기화이며 공식 JAX 구현의 작은 PyTorch 구조 예제입니다.","summary":"패치 축과 채널 축을 별도 MLP로 혼합하는 이미지 분류 구조.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a77b77b626a50d140b1eda13","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"구조를 이루는 주요 구성 요소.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/15582f79877c819b11ea3f0a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"LDM의 잠재 확산에서 U-Net 백본을 패치 Transformer로 교체합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"Abstract; §2–3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ldm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space_kernel","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"State-space convolution kernel","label":"State-space convolution kernel","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space"},"summary":"선형 상태공간 recurrence를 시퀀스 convolution kernel로 변환해 병렬 계산합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"family":"graph","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_aggregation"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Graph Convolutional Network","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"GCN","label":"Graph Convolutional Network","reference_year":2016,"runtime_id":"gcn","runtime_note":"5개 노드의 2층 GCN. self-loop·대칭 차수 정규화·이웃 집계와 선형 투영을 실행합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"그래프 구조와 노드 특징을 이웃 집계로 함께 학습합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/48194b89f3d9de5df4b21c2b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"ViT 기반 인코더를 가시 패치에 적용하고 별도 디코더로 가려진 픽셀을 복원합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/visual_representation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c22c6de470a74cc2d554a2b4","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"explanation":"패치 기반 분류에서 어텐션 대신 토큰·채널 MLP 혼합을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"locator":"Paper §2, Fig.1; https://github.com/google-research/vision_transformer/blob/main/vit_jax/models_mixer.py (MixerBlock, MlpMixer)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mixer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/68081db55c75c81df7d4763e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"행동 조건을 세계 모델에 전달합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamer4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_action_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/momentum_target","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/byol"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Momentum target network","label":"Momentum target network","summary":"온라인 네트워크 파라미터의 지수 이동 평균으로 표적 네트워크를 천천히 갱신합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1bf5cb221e45361ff65abe2c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/decision_transformer"},"explanation":"return에 조건부로 궤적의 행동을 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/decision_transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/decision_transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_action_prediction"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/generation","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"자료 생성","label":"자료 생성","summary":"학습한 분포로부터 새로운 표본을 생성합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d412dd1332cacd4b876b0330","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"모델의 원논문과 공식 구현.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §4, Fig.2–3; https://github.com/bmild/nerf/blob/master/run_nerf_helpers.py (Embedder, init_nerf_model); run_nerf.py (run_network, raw2outputs)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nerf"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/41f0f91f1dd2a377bedd9cbd","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"locator":"Paper §5.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/coordinate_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tabnet_input_normalization","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"TabNet input normalization","label":"TabNet input normalization","summary":"표 특성의 수치 범위를 decision step 전에 정규화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_successor_features","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Successor features","label":"Successor features","summary":"미래 상태 특징의 할인 누적을 예측합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tabnet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/tabular_prediction"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tabnet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"family":"tabular","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tabnet_input_normalization"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/attentive_transformer"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/feature_transformer"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decision_aggregation"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"TabNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Attentive Interpretable Tabular Network","label":"TabNet","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"tabnet","runtime_note":"연속 특성 10개에 두 decision step을 적용하는 작은 예제입니다. input normalization, prior-scaled soft feature mask, gated feature transformer와 decision aggregation을 실행합니다. 원논문의 sparsemax, ghost batch normalization, shared transformer layers, categorical embedding과 self-supervised pretraining은 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"여러 decision step에서 attentive mask로 표 특성을 선택하고 변환된 decision representation을 합치는 tabular architecture입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sequential_feature_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/feature_masking"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/decision_step_aggregation"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"노드 분류","label":"노드 분류","summary":"그래프의 노드에 범주를 할당합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0195dd0fc20e451e29c317c0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"잡음 단계를 확산 네트워크에 주입합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3.1; official timestep_embedding","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ldm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/diffusion_time_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/db4425ea4c191946c80fb867","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"explanation":"GAN: 적대적 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gan"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/adversarial"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5e17158c70a9cb410aee292a","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/clip"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/clip"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/image_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mamba2_output_gate","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mamba-2 output gate","label":"Mamba-2 output gate","summary":"입력 의존 gate로 SSD 출력을 조절합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9baf2b160bf75e4cf73f1731","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"max pooling은 점 순서와 무관한 대칭 함수입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"§3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/symmetric_max_pool"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/symmetric_reduction"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ssl_encoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Shared visual encoder","label":"Shared visual encoder","summary":"두 증강 시점에 같은 파라미터를 적용해 시각 표현을 만듭니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_skill_diversity","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Skill diversity objective","label":"Skill diversity objective","summary":"행동 스킬과 방문 상태 사이의 구별 가능성을 높입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0c946b376cef40b95484e3c2","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"explanation":"환경에서 장기 성과를 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rainbow"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b4fd928393295248eeed419f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"block 출력에 SE channel gate를 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"Fig.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/se_residual_block"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/squeeze_excitation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/123d0119a56bba17bf15496a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"explanation":"여러 block과 stack이 residual links로 연결됩니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nbeats"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/nbeats_block_stack"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4878da1a8f56c246afafd215","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"VAE 잠재 패치에서 확산 노이즈를 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3; Fig.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_diffusion"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba2","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba"},"family":"state-space","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mamba2_input_projection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ssd_core"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mamba2_output_gate"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mamba2_output_projection"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mamba-2","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"State Space Dual Model","label":"Mamba-2","reference_year":2024,"runtime_id":"mamba2","runtime_note":"8개 토큰·폭 8 입력을 split projection, 폭 16의 작은 scalar-transition SSD recurrence, SiLU gate와 출력 투영으로 처리합니다. CUDA chunk scan, tensor parallelism, 언어 임베딩·LM head, 대규모 학습과 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"상태공간 모델과 attention의 구조적 이중성을 이용해 SSD 핵심층을 더 큰 head dimension으로 효율화한 시퀀스 구조입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space_duality"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/semiseparable_matrix"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ssd_algorithm"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic","@type":"Paper","author":["Vijay Konda","John Tsitsiklis"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Actor-Critic Algorithms","label":"Actor-Critic Algorithms","reference_year":1999,"summary":"Actor–Critic의 대표 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://papers.nips.cc/paper_files/paper/1999/hash/6449f44a102fde848669bdd9eb6b76fa-Abstract.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1dfe3b988881a5bc84d8d7d7","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"explanation":"저주파 mode에 학습된 Fourier multiplier를 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno"},"locator":"§3.2, Eq.4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/fno"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/spectral_convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f57bfbd8e4c72b121fe173d4","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/router"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a60d93f3c270a6bc60556936","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg