component/encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/conditional_image_generation","@type":"Task","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Conditional image generation","label":"Conditional image generation","summary":"텍스트나 클래스 같은 외부 조건에 맞는 이미지를 생성합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4bd1171eef23c5b30ba3d11f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"두 시점에 같은 인코더 파라미터를 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"§2, Fig.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ssl_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nerf","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/novel_view_synthesis"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"family":"generative","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/coordinate_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/radiance_mlp"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/density_head"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/view_color_head"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/volume_renderer"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"NeRF","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Neural Radiance Fields","label":"NeRF","reference_year":2020,"runtime_id":"nerf","runtime_note":"광선 2개와 각 6개 표본, 작은 위치 인코더·MLP·알파 합성기. 계층 표본추출과 실제 카메라 기하는 생략한 무작위 초기화 구조 예제입니다.","summary":"3D 위치와 시선 방향에서 밀도·색을 예측하고 광선을 따라 볼륨 렌더링합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/photometric_mse"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/radiance_field"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/fourier_features"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/volume_rendering"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/view_dependent_radiance"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/critical_point_selection","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Critical-point selection","label":"Critical-point selection","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/symmetric_reduction"},"summary":"채널별 최대값을 제공하는 일부 점이 전역 형상 표현을 결정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7b1b15c0ed00c537d01dc096","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/depthwise"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/44e699bdae6976d6a2ecf20d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 지도 분류 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/075a4085a9597e097990578d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"정의와 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#