,"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"family":"vision","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_backbone"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detr_decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/object_queries"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/detection_heads"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DETR","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"DEtection TRansformer","label":"DETR","reference_year":2020,"runtime_id":"detr","runtime_note":"16×16 이미지, 5개 객체 질의, 한 층 인코더·디코더와 3개 객체 클래스. 무작위 초기화된 구조 예제이며 작은 완전탐색 이분 매칭 손실을 제공합니다.","summary":"학습된 객체 질의를 Transformer 디코더에 넣어 고정 크기 탐지 집합을 병렬 예측합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/set_prediction_loss"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/direct_set_prediction"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/object_queries"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/bipartite_matching"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sparse_experts","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"희소 전문가","label":"희소 전문가","summary":"입력에 따라 일부 전문가만 활성화하는 구성."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5534543113c0790e1d196220","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"SSM 변환 행렬을 semiseparable 구조로 해석합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/semiseparable_matrix"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"family":"recurrent-language","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/token_embedding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rwkv_time_mix"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rwkv_channel_mix"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rwkv_normalization"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/language_head"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RWKV","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Receptance Weighted Key Value","label":"RWKV","reference_year":2023,"runtime_id":"rwkv","runtime_note":"어휘 32·폭 12·길이 10의 작은 RWKV-4-inspired recurrent 예제로 token embedding, 안정화된 time-mix 누산, gated channel-mix, normalization과 LM head를 실행합니다. 공식 CUDA WKV kernel, 병렬 training form, time-shift 보간, 깊은 residual stack과 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"receptance와 시간 감쇠 weighted key-value 누산을 결합해 Transformer식 병렬 학습과 RNN식 선형 추론을 연결하는 언어 모델 구조입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weighted_key_value"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/time_mixing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_mixing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/parallel_recurrent_equivalence"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/29ff251df9daa0d084142166","@type":"Claim","basis":"pedagogical","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"explanation":"GCN보다 강한 multiset 구별력을 목표로 하는 메시지 전달 계보입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gin"},"locator":"§3, Table 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5b4d898d9986fdd51f987943","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 이웃 집계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_aggregation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/38b640774bf84894ef60d0f3","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/graph_attention"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RL observation encoder","label":"RL observation encoder","summary":"상태나 관측을 신경망 특징으로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/33d7f7e469b4dcaa92bfb1b2","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"explanation":"LSTM의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/lstm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn","@type":"Paper","author":["Thomas N. Kipf","Max Welli