ed_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/view_dependent_radiance"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_array","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Learned latent array","label":"Learned latent array","summary":"입력 길이와 무관한 학습 가능한 고정 개수 잠재 질의입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tcn_sequence_head","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"TCN sequence head","label":"TCN sequence head","summary":"마지막 temporal representation을 task output으로 투영합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dqn","@type":"Paper","author":["Volodymyr Mnih","Koray Kavukcuoglu","David Silver","Alex Graves","Ioannis Antonoglou","Daan Wierstra","Martin Riedmiller"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Playing Atari with Deep Reinforcement Learning","label":"Playing Atari with Deep Reinforcement Learning","reference_year":2013,"summary":"심층 신경망으로 Atari의 행동 가치를 추정한 DQN 논문입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.5602"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3b13a231e265fcad8a8c67aa","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"explanation":"모델의 원문과 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"},"locator":"Title; official deepmind-research/perceiver/perceiver.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceiver"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceiver"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/68c6d8af327b526f8e92e896","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"GraphSAGE-mean 실행 경로의 실제 구성 요소입니다.","http://