I/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"locator":"Paper §2, Fig.1; https://github.com/google-research/vision_transformer/blob/main/vit_jax/models_mixer.py (MixerBlock, MlpMixer)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/channel_mixer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_mixing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a00cb8e1aca012359381be50","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"explanation":"환경에서 장기 성과를 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a13752826615c6d7d77d0c96","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"explanation":"network depth와 dilation이 effective history 크기를 정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/temporal_receptive_field"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neighbor_projection","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"GraphSAGE neighbor projection","label":"GraphSAGE neighbor projection","summary":"집계한 이웃 특징을 공유 가중치로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1bf102110a1d52ca3dea73f4","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":