929","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"Deep Sets의 대표 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"Title; §2–4; official manzilzaheer/DeepSets repository","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/deepsets"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/dd719d700e9872fa1e054dd1","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"explanation":"forecast horizon의 point error를 최소화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nbeats"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/point_forecasting"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1ae098520f956e0fe87d9549","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"explanation":"CNN · LeNet 계열의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/260e9f5addf16ea213b56902","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"explanation":"Q 함수를 추정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/sac"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_q_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d67ee691cc41e778780af6f8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"조건 표현을 교차 어텐션 층에 주입합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_denoiser"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention_conditioning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6a716b0ef6952bd4222f9745","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"explanation":"queue dictionary 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"locator":"§3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/negative_queue"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3b12b0b8d5f5b881a4f4c8c7","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"explanation":"상상 경로에서 정책을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv2"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6c5fb737d07c95a4c85ef3e3","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/poin