I/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3bb0f3d236918f5d1592e9ed","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"정의와 구조의 원문 근거.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.2, Fig.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/object_queries"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ba3870c1ca893f16fee6e71d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"PointNet Fig. 2; §3–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/input_transform"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cdfc10f7269663f5ae67fcce","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"explanation":"Variational Autoencoder: 재매개화.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/reparameterization"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/retnet","@type":"Paper","author":["Yutao Sun","Li Dong","Shaohan Huang","Shuming Ma","Yuqing Xia","Jilong Xue","Jianyong Wang","Furu Wei"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Retentive Network: A Successor to Transformer for Large Languag