ce":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/diffusion"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c3e6332c23898d95337e2408","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"token ID를 연속 feature로 바꿉니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/token_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Self-Attention","label":"Self-Attention","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"},"summary":"같은 입력 시퀀스에서 만든 query, key, value를 이용해 위치 사이의 정보를 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2deb9eb7f3e6da8b7e912187","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"explanation":"가치 기반 advantage 추정과 정책 학습을 결합합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ppo"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/sac","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/td3"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/sac"},"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_q_head"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Soft Actor-Critic","label":"Soft Actor-Critic","reference_year":2018,"runtime_id":"sac_rl","runtime_note":"8차원 상태에서 Gaussian actor의 평균·log 표준편차와 두 state-action critic을 실행합니다. 이중 critic을 사용하는 후속 변형을 따른 작은 구조 예제이며 sampling, target network, entropy temperature 및 학습은 생략합니다.","summary":"최대 엔트로피 목표를 사용하는 off-policy 확률적 actor–critic입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_max_entropy"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit","@type":"Paper","author":["Alexey Dosovitskiy","Lucas Beyer","Alexander Kolesnikov","Dirk Weissenborn","Xiaohua Zhai","Thomas Unterthiner","Mostafa Dehghani","Matthias Minderer","Georg Heigold","Sylvain Gelly","Jakob Uszkoreit","Neil Houlsby"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"An Image is Worth 16x16 Words: Transformers for Image Recognition at Scale","label":"An Image is Worth 16x16 Words: Transformers for Image Recognition at Scale","reference_year":2020,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.11929"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a115a4d7caa6038db647740f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"이 노드의 정의와 구조적 역할을 뒷받침하는 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"Deep Sets §2–4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/element_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7d9ec8135e53c8d0e988c685","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"explanation":"causal padding과 dilation으로 미래 누출 없이 수용 영역을 넓힙니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":