을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/actor_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_actor_critic"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/627584681ec108a91b0804d4","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn"},"explanation":"환경에서 장기 성과를 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dueling_dqn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dueling_dqn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/139564ea1094f07fafb566f5","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"explanation":"T5: Transformer 디코더 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9a5c5dd8cc9194b5c5b6d192","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/denoiser"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/denoising"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c084dc1e6837bb780c678962","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/alphazero"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/alphazero"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/alphazero"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e80cf77f1762666ec7818765","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"explanation":"VGG: 합성곱.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5bb3df25ef84d76a5ee08818","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"explanation":"SSD core 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"},"locator":"Algorithm 1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ssd_core"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba2"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/bipartite_matching","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Bipartite matching","label":"Bipartite matching","summary":"예측 슬롯과 정답 객체 사이의 일대일 최소 비용 대응을 선택합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/77a08fed09f1537e0a615493","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"잠재공간 확산 목적을 Tra