cec41dc6c","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"ResNet의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e2aa8ec04ae7f32efeed61ec","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"전역 형상 표현을 만드는 대칭 max 연산입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"Fig. 2; §3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/symmetric_max_pool"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neural_vector_field","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Neural vector field module","label":"Neural vector field module","summary":"현재 상태에서 시간 미분을 계산하는 학습 가능한 함수입니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neural_vector_field"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_temporal_options","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Temporally extended options","label":"Temporally extended options","summary":"여러 단계 지속되는 정책과 종료 조건을 표현합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/904ae971dcce21416e7004b0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"explanation":"Hungarian 대응 뒤 분류·상자 손실로 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"locator":"Paper §3.1, Eq.1–2; official models/detr.py (SetCriterion)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/detr"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/set_prediction_loss"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3c4dec866dc41e7c1f25a44b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"explanation":"분류·예측 benchmark의 지도 loss를 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/451a9535c940472011298c33","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"explanation":"자기지도 비전 표현을 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"locator":"§4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4feadf5bd349e99b1f91970a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"잠재 입력을 고정 크기 패치 토큰으로 변환합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3; official PatchEmbed","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_patch_embed"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b8558bb313315bcb44e0db2a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"잠재 패치 토큰 전체에 self-attention을 적용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f0d78d365938cc0d0b2935d9","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"채널 특징을 S4 내부 폭에 맞춥니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"§4; official S4 layer wrappers","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/s4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/s4_input_projection"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/92186a2938122acd9ad1f59d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"explanation":"backcast가 다음 block의 residual history를 만듭니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats"},"locator":"§3.1, Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nbeats"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/backcast_head"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bc3164a5242f074c18f76277","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"explanation":"일반 convolution을 causal·dilated temporal stack으로 특화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3d4ab362da14eabe4974a8f9","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: 기계 번역.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/translation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/dilated_causal_convolution","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Dilated causal convolution module","label":"Dilated causal convolution module","summary":"왼쪽 과거만 참조하는 dilated one-dimensional convolution입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats","@type":"Paper","author":["Boris N. Oreshkin","Dmitri Carpov","Nicolas Chapados","Yoshua Bengio"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"N-BEATS: Neural Basis Expansion Analysis for Interpretable Time Series Forecasting","label":"N-BEATS: Neural Basis Expansion Analysis for Interpretable Time Series Forecasting","reference_year":2020,"summary":"backcast와 forecast를 잇는 이중 residual stack과 학습 가능한 basis expansion을 제안한 원논문이며 ServiceNow/N-BEATS가 공식 구현입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://openreview.net/forum?id=r1ecqn4YwB"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ce140f35f8706470bbb272f8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"explanation":"GAN: Discriminator.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gan"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/discriminator"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/denoising","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"노이즈 제거","label":"노이즈 제거","summary":"손상된 자료에서 잡음이나 깨끗한 신호를 추정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adversarial","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"적대적 학습","label":"적대적 학습","summary":"생성자와 판별자의 경쟁을 이용해 분포를 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4412bdef5405b508f4507449","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"ViT 기반 인코더를 가시 패치에 적용하고 별도 디코더로 가려진 픽셀을 복원합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/visible_patch_encoding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_symlog","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Symlog scaling","label":"Symlog scaling","summary":"큰 양수와 음수를 대칭 로그 스케일로 압축합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/view_color_head","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"View-dependent color head","label":"View-dependent color head","summary":"공간 특징과 시선 방향을 결합해 RGB를 예측합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/view_dependent_radiance"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/84af8c00958d4d3f9b50bb4e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://gi