"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/reinforce"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/reinforce"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/671436f8066c3d68dfc171fd","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"행동 정책을 출력합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/862efd38c20918d0c2fb7d63","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"explanation":"query-key 사전 조회를 대조 학습으로 최적화합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"locator":"Eq.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/moco"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b7ab15c181291737653e17ef","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"explanation":"ConvNeXt: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/convnext"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1a577a832487f1dd3772d9c9","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"explanation":"RNN · Elman 계열의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba","@type":"Paper","author":["Albert Gu","Tri Dao"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mamba: Linear-Time Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces","label":"Mamba: Linear-Time Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces","reference_year":2023,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.00752"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceptron","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron"},"family":"feedforward","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Perceptron","label":"Perceptron","reference_year":1958,"runtime_id":"perceptron","runtime_note":"실제 임계 출력을 사용하는 작은 예제입니다. 미분 불가능한 출력이므로 backward 검증은 지원하지 않습니다.","summary":"가중합과 임계 판단으로 이진 출력을 만드는 단일 유닛부터 살펴봅니다. 임계 연산은 일반적인 역전파로 학습하지 않습니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weighted_sum"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"ResNet","label":"ResNet","reference_year":2015,"runtime_id":"resnet18","runtime_note":"TorchVision ResNet18을 무작위 가중치로 실행합니다. vision 추가 의존성이 필요하며 모델 가중치를 다운로드하지 않습니다.","summary":"합성곱 변환에 입력 경로를 더하는 잔차 블록을 이용합니다. 내부 채널 폭과 잔차 출력 폭을 나눠 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer","@type":"Paper","author":["Jianlin Su","Yu Lu","Shengfeng Pan","Ahmed Murtadha","Bo Wen","Yunfeng Liu"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RoFormer: Enhanced Transformer with Rotary Position Embedding","label":"RoFormer: Enhanced Transformer with Rotary Position Embedding","reference_year":2021,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.09864"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5e7f5d4fc64b5b85d83dc478","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: Self-Attention 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/set_prediction_loss","@type":"Objective","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/detr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Bipartite set prediction loss","label":"Bipartite set prediction loss","summary":"이분 매칭 뒤 클래스와 상자 오차를 결합하는 탐지 목적."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet","@type":"Paper","author":["Mingxing Tan","Quoc V. Le"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"EfficientNet: Rethinking Model Scaling for Convolutional Neural Networks","label":"EfficientNet: Rethinking Model Scaling for Convolutional Neural Networks","reference_year":2019,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.11946"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#