-kg#claim/aa1ba89cbc207d8ce6f4b2db","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"원 논문의 인코더/디코더 블록 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c8ab53feb1dbdf39cb69a869","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/planet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/planet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4b445e049dc40a169901599f","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"explanation":"집합 표현을 예측으로 변환하는 rho 실행 모듈입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"locator":"§2 Eq. 4","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/deepsets"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/set_readout"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/23c0ec5398f95dc90cff3818","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 노드 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"