ub.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/parallel_recurrent_equivalence","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Parallel–recurrent equivalence","label":"Parallel–recurrent equivalence","summary":"동일한 시퀀스 변환을 병렬 학습식과 고정 상태 순환 추론식으로 계산합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/photometric_mse","@type":"Objective","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Photometric reconstruction MSE","label":"Photometric reconstruction MSE","summary":"렌더링한 광선 색과 관측 픽셀 색의 평균 제곱 오차."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo","@type":"Paper","author":["John Schulman","Filip Wolski","Prafulla Dhariwal","Alec Radford","Oleg Klimov"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Proximal Policy Optimization Algorithms","label":"Proximal Policy Optimization Algorithms","reference_year":2017,"summary":"clipped surrogate objective를 이용하는 정책 최적화 알고리즘입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1707.06347"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6b09c530cbbed3ce04a672c4","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"DreamerV2 세계 모델과 학습을 개선합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv2"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/051b2cbc6f725f033d522506","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/world_models"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/world_models"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_dynamics"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shared_element_encoding","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Shared element encoding","label":"Shared element encoding","summary":"같은 학습 가능 함수를 집합의 각 원소에 독립적으로 적용합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/027773043db1feda4ed396fa","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"explanation":"정의와 구조적 역할의 원문 및 공식 구현 근거입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"locator":"SimCLR §2–3; official implementation","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/nt_xent"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/993b943445c1e01f2ecefc0f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"explanation":"상태에서 스킬을 예측합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/diayn"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/diayn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_skill_discriminator"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6f2e142662f0065868a80533","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"explanation":"Transformer를 사용한 확산 노이즈 제거 예측입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dit"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/transformer_denoiser"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/denoising"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/forecast_head","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Forecast head","label":"Forecast head","summary":"현재 block의 미래 예측 성분을 출력합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0b858e8770b8b02cf9837a6e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpg"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2bf3b1242a1e8e8fb22f214c","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"explanation":"교사 분포를 학생의 레이블 없는 표적으로 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dino"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dino"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_distillation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps","@type":"Paper","author":["Hao Liu","Pieter Abbeel"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"APS: Active Pretraining with Successor Features","label":"APS: Active Pretraining with Successor Features","reference_year":2021,"summary":"successor feature와 비모수 엔트로피를 결합한 사전학습입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v139/liu21b.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceptron"},"family":"feedforward","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"MLP","label":"MLP","reference_year":1986,"runtime_id":"mlp","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"여러 선형 층과 비선형 활성화를 쌓아 입력 표현을 바꿉니다. 1986년 문헌은 대표적인 역전파 학습 설명에 연결됩니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weighted_sum"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3","@type":"Paper","author":["Danijar Hafner","Jurgis Pasukonis","Jimmy Ba","Timothy Lillicrap"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mastering Diverse Domains through World Models","label":"Mastering Diverse Domains through World Models","reference_year":2023,"summary":"다양한 영역에 단일 설정을 적용하는 DreamerV3입니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.04104"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b5620ec94bb7e01ac647de3b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"구조를 이루는 주요 구성 요소.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/396dca5780679f4e0de6769b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/skip_connections"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2c79f8346b2a822314cfbfae","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"explanation":"Inception · GoogLeNet: 다중 스케일 처리.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/inception"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multiscale"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a9b7e507aea554d9bbe3d2cf","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"explanation":"LLaMA · 2023: 인과적 마스킹.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/llama"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/causal_mask"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1b420500ac92807c10b49edb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"explanation":"Variational Autoencoder: 잠재 디코더.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gru","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"family":"sequence","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/recurrent"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"GRU","label":"GRU","reference_year":2014,"runtime_id":"gru","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"게이트를 이용해 순환 상태의 갱신과 유지를 조절합니다. 원 문헌의 RNN Encoder-Decoder와 여기의 작은 분류기 예제는 서로 다른 전체 모델입니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/gating"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1cff34a7b93b31c34ecedf72","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"explanation":"패치 기반 분류에서 어텐션 대신 토큰·채널 MLP 혼합을 사용합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mixer"},"locator":"Paper §2, Fig.1; https://github.com/google-research/vision_transformer/blob/main/vit_jax/models_mixer.py (MixerBlock, MlpMixer)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mixer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/65fb2b1db45b4e7a50ce0535","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"explanation":"일반 조건 입력을 교차 어텐션으로 U-Net에 연결합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ldm"},"locator":"§3.3, Eq.3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ldm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention_conditioning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/token_embedding","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Token embedding","label":"Token embedding","summary":"이산 token ID를 학습 가능한 연속 feature로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상 분할","label":"영상 분할","summary":"영상의 위치별 범주를 예측합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/33b2a7f732f8265baa545a4d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"explanation":"입력과 block 출력을 직접 더합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/tcn"},"locator":"§3.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/tcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tcn_residual_path"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4ab94bb24d608af4f1d84428","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: Feed-forward 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn"},"applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"family":"graph","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_aggregation"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Graph Attention Network","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"GAT","label":"Graph Attention Network","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"gat","runtime_note":"5개 노드의 1-head GAT. 이웃 마스킹·additive attention·softmax 집계를 실행합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"어텐션 가중치로 그래프 이웃의 표현을 집계합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/graph_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4d4520620e7f399fe4857bf6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"길이 16K를 포함한 장거리 벤치마크를 평가합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator":"Abstract; §4.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/s4"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/long_range_sequence"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/in_batch_negatives","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/simclr"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"In-batch negatives","label":"In-batch negatives","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"},"summary":"같은 미니배치의 다른 표본 시점을 대조 목적의 음성 쌍으로 사용합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c386a457e25bdcbfd75421ae","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"explanation":"기대 보상 향상을 목표로 합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ppo"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ppo"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/efbb1a7687af819ee5b739d6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: 위치 표현 모듈.","http:/