oI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/alphazero"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/84f5cb296c23b89a1b96332f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"SE는 전역 squeeze와 excitation으로 수행하는 채널 재보정 방식입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"§3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/squeeze_excitation"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_recalibration"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sample_and_aggregate","@type":"Concept","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Sample and aggregate","label":"Sample and aggregate","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"},"summary":"이웃 표본화와 집계를 반복해 중심 노드의 표현을 갱신합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f56f4ebe046f866feea66af5","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: Multi-Head Attention.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5","@type":"Paper","author":["Colin Raffel","Noam Shazeer","Adam Roberts","Katherine Lee","Sharan Narang","Michael Matena","Yanqi Zhou","Wei Li","Peter J. Liu"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Exploring the Limits of Transfer Learning with a Unified Text-to-Text Transformer","label":"Exploring the Limits of Transfer Learning with a Unified Text-to-Text Transformer","reference_year":2019,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.10683"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/volume_renderer","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nerf"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Alpha-compositing renderer","label":"Alpha-compositing renderer","summary":"순서가 있는 광선 표본의 색과 밀도를 한 픽셀로 합성합니다.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/volume_rendering"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/deepsets","@type":"Paper","author":["Manzil Zaheer","Satwik Kottur","Siamak Ravanbakhsh","Barnabas Poczos","Ruslan Salakhutdinov","Alexander J. Smola"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Deep Sets","label":"Deep Sets","reference_year":2017,"summary":"집합 함수의 순열 불변성을 rho(sum(phi(x))) 계열로 특성화하고 다양한 집합 학습 과제에 적용한 원논문.","url":{"@id":"https://papers.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2017/hash/f22e4747da1aa27e363d86d40ff442fe-Abstract.html"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d12719cef9b87846a68c7656","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"학습은 병렬화하고 추론은 고정 상태 recurrence로 계산합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"Abstract; §3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/parallel_recurrent_equivalence"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/25e3638b743521d180d4ffee","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"explanation":"상태공간 dynamics를 convolution 형태로 표현합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/s4"},"locator"