t"},"explanation":"전역 평균으로 채널 descriptor를 만듭니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"§3.1, Eq.2","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/senet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/squeeze_pool"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e0aa3025c5e30e73c1fd8c8d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"explanation":"GraphSAGE-mean 실행 경로의 실제 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/graphsage"},"locator":"§2, Eq.1; official graphsage/models.py","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/graphsage"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_projection"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cbdf4b8d78cb2a65a985fe82","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"explanation":"RNN · Elman 계열의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"family":"sequence","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/recurrent"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RNN · Elman 계열","label":"RNN · Elman 계열","reference_year":1990,"runtime_id":"rnn","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"같은 순환 연산과 이전 상태를 반복해 시퀀스의 문맥을 표현합니다. 실행 예제에서 출력과 숨은 상태를 함께 관찰할 수 있습니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/49b3ae1d5822fc7613316f00","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"explanation":"T-Net이 입력 또는 특징 정렬을 학습합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"locator":"Fig. 2; §3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/input_transform"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/input_alignment"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4d0946729ee304e1fa051581","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"explanation":"입력별 채널 응답을 적응적으로 재보정합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/senet"},"locator":"Abstract; §3","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/senet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/channel_recalibration"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4bd0788fda7cd683575e62cc","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"explanation":"대조 임베딩 query 투영입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"locator":"§3; official builder.py encoder_q.fc","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/moco"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/query_projector"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8c504263ec899fc0024d5707","@type":"Claim","bas