ttps://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e4707bfc7ab2275c22692777","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"explanation":"MLP의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg","@type":"Paper","author":["Karen Simonyan","Andrew Zisserman"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Very Deep Convolutional Networks for Large-Scale Image Recognition","label":"Very Deep Convolutional Networks for Large-Scale Image Recognition","reference_year":2014,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.1556"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/llama","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"LLaMA · 2023","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"LLAMA","label":"LLaMA · 2023","reference_year":2023,"runtime_id":"llama","runtime_note":"Transformers LLaMA 1층·폭 16. RMSNorm·RoPE·SwiGLU·causal attention을 포함합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"RoPE·RMSNorm·SwiGLU를 결합한 초기 LLaMA 자기회귀 구조.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/causal_mask"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rotary_position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rms_norm"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/swiglu"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/attentive_transformer","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Attentive transformer","label":"Attentive transformer","summary":"이전 step 표현과 prior에서 특성 선택 mask를 계산합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/time_mixing","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Time mixing","label":"Time mixing","summary":"시퀀스 축의 과거 정보를 학습된 감쇠와 receptance gate로 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6591d51c526ec3a500ca73a6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"explanation":"대표 참고 문헌입니다. 연도는 이 문헌 기준이며 모델 계열의 최초 발명 연도를 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gru"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/key_encoder","@type":"Component","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"MoCo key encoder","label":"MoCo key encoder","summary":"query 인코더의 지수 이동 평균으로 갱신되는 키 인코더입니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/92d8364bd485602d204145bd","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"explanation":"EfficientNet: 영상 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"h