thub.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/span_corruption"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rainbow","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_control"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rainbow"},"extends":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dqn"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/double_dqn"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dueling_dqn"}],"family":"reinforcement-learning","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_value_stream"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_advantage_stream"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Rainbow","label":"Rainbow","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"rainbow_rl","runtime_note":"두 갈래 dueling head가 행동별 5개 categorical atom logits를 출력합니다. NoisyNet, prioritized replay, n-step target, 학습과 실제 Atari encoder는 생략합니다.","summary":"Rainbow 강화학습 구조 및 알고리즘입니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/rl_return"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_value_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d5e75e1d6b874cd36fc936b6","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"Transformer 구성 요소를 채택하고 입력·마스킹·학습 구성을 변경.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7ef9c21ba77defb43e45e86b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"explanation":"quadratic attention 없이 선형시간·상수상태 추론을 목표로 합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/rwkv"},"locator":"Abstract; §1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#alternative_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rwkv"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/pointnet","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/point_cloud_classification"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/point_segmentation"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/pointnet"},"family":"3d","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/input_transform"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/shared_point_mlp"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/symmetric_max_pool"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/shape_classifier"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"PointNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"Point Net","label":"PointNet","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"pointnet","runtime_note":"16개 3D 점에 공유 MLP와 대칭 max pooling을 적용하는 작은 형상 분류 예제입니다. 입력·특징 변환망과 분할 경로는 생략하며 무작위 초기화입니다.","summary":"정렬되지 않은 3D 점마다 공유 MLP를 적용하고 채널별 최대 풀링으로 전역 형상 표현을 만듭니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/permutation_invariance"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shared_element_encoding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/symmetric_reduction"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/pointwise_feature_learning"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/critical_point_selection"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/input_alignment"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/71e8db551a6ddd522985f5da","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"},"explanation":"실행 예제에 연결된 신경망 구성 요소입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/actor_critic"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/actor_critic"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/rl_actor"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/74fe41908d10b89da1a92172","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"explanation":"다양한 크기의 신호를 symlog로 다룹니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamerv3"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/dreamerv3"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_symlog"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7630694ba88236f3c8843a3a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"explanation":"ViT 기반 인코더를 가시 패치에 적용하고 별도 디코더로 가려진 픽셀을 복원합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae"},"locator":"Paper §3, Fig.1; https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae/blob/main/models_mae.py (forward_encoder, forward_decoder, forward_loss)","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/1ea2b36d522bcf81ef243f63","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"explanation":"Dreamer 4 원논문입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/dreamer4"},"r