c6850a2e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shifted_windows"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/window_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/compound_scaling","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"복합 스케일링","label":"복합 스케일링","summary":"모델 깊이·너비·입력 해상도를 함께 조절합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3f28b87a6fdb7aaa7085e904","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"explanation":"Transformer 구성 요소를 채택하고 입력·마스킹·학습 구성을 변경.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dilated_causal_convolution","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Dilated causal convolution","label":"Dilated causal convolution","summary":"미래 입력을 보지 않으면서 간격이 커지는 kernel로 과거 수용 영역을 확장합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ba61b117ba150ab547b04df0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"explanation":"보상 없는 사전학습을 수행합니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/aps"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/aps"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/rl_skill_learning"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8f598811d2bb8a8804